    <node id="Garhoel Thaterona">
      <data key="d0">Garhoel Thaterona</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A Procurement Manager who is coordinating cross-departmental efforts for upcoming initiatives.&lt;SEP&gt;A member of the Fozola Applied Research Lab who leads a study on scalable data architectures and collaborates with the product development lead to integrate findings into the product roadmap.&lt;SEP&gt;A Procurement Manager at Zastama Industries who supports initiatives like Project Velbirum by securing necessary resources in a timely and cost-effective manner.&lt;SEP&gt;A team member who reports to Pinhan Bilfael and is instrumental in coordinating cross-functional support for Project Vatuen. Also leads Project Laboel.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-002-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-045-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-100-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-112-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-002&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-045&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-100&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-112</data>
      <data key="d5">1793666542</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Hindas Brukruan">
      <data key="d0">Hindas Brukruan</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A member of the Fozola Applied Research Lab who is involved in material innovation and collaborates with the procurement team.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual who supervises Toperel Brirdoan and reports to Votirmi Tresbior in the research division of Zastama Industries.&lt;SEP&gt;An employee at Zastama Industries who supports the operations division and reports to Votirmi Tresbior.&lt;SEP&gt;A key figure in the organizational structure of Zastama Industries who reports to Votirmi Tresbior and supports key operational functions.&lt;SEP&gt;A key leader who joined the company in 2021 and has been instrumental in the development and optimization of the Zathunel Beacon.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-002-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-069-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-078-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-087-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-070-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-002&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-069&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-078&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-087&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-070</data>
      <data key="d5">1793757981</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Vosaett Neldelis">
      <data key="d0">Vosaett Neldelis</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Vosaett Neldelis is an employee at Zastama Industries who has been with the company since 2021 and is based at the Lardoel Campus. They are a core contributor to the procurement and reconciliation team, specializing in payments reconciliation and overseeing procurement orders such as AB-8993-C. Vosaett plays a key role in ensuring financial flows align with project objectives, particularly for initiatives like Project Ruzonine and Project Medeis. Their work has contributed to the timely closure of financial statements and the resolution of vendor-related discrepancies.

In addition to financial responsibilities, Vosaett is involved in cross-departmental coordination and the operational support of mission-critical systems. They report to Drisfer Ganlanis and have taken on new responsibilities that reflect their growing influence within the organization. Vosaett is also instrumental in supporting regional operations, collaborating with the Zugula Infrastructure Team on data routing and redundancy. They coordinate the infrastructure review of the Garelor Relay and the Zoluna Data Center, including forming a task force and communicating updates to all employees.

Vosaett Neldelis attended the Q2 Strategic Review and Operational Planning Meeting, where they shared insights from a recent employee engagement survey and recommended a quarterly internal training initiative. Their contributions span procurement, financial reconciliation, infrastructure coordination, and strategic planning, making them a vital team member at Zastama Industries.&lt;SEP&gt;The head of the strategic development division at Zastama Industries, based at the Lardoel Campus. Plays a central role in coordinating efforts between departments and external partners.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-002-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-014-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-023-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-094-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-104-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-043-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-047-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-034-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-099-chunk-000</data>
