      <data key="d5">1793759768</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Thegen Zilkanett">
      <data key="d0">Thegen Zilkanett</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A point of contact for internal coordination and leadership alignment within Zastama Industries.&lt;SEP&gt;A UX Researcher at Zastama Industries who joined with a mandate to improve the user experience of identity and access systems. Their work has contributed to the integration of these systems with back-end financial processes.&lt;SEP&gt;An employee at Zastama Industries who supports internal workflows and team alignment, reporting to Thikama Harlurine.&lt;SEP&gt;A key contributor to Project Sankonen, focusing on ensuring the project’s alignment with broader business objectives and technical constraints.&lt;SEP&gt;A UX Researcher at Zastama Industries who has collaborated with the Trehaett Applied Research Lab on the Samopunel Beacon project. They provided feedback on user experience and emphasized the importance of user-centered design.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-002-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-064-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-075-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-109-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-082-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-002&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-064&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-075&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-109&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-082</data>
      <data key="d5">1793758072</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Thikama Harlurine">
      <data key="d0">Thikama Harlurine</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">An individual overseeing broader operations and providing feedback on material innovation initiatives.&lt;SEP&gt;A member of Zastama Industries' management structure who is currently reporting to Dretho Stopasel as part of an effort to streamline internal communications and improve decision-making speed.&lt;SEP&gt;Thikama Harlurine is a Data Scientist at Zastama Industries who contributes to the analytical backbone of projects. She translates complex datasets into actionable strategies and supports decision-making.&lt;SEP&gt;A senior leader at Zastama Industries who has been with the company since 2018. They guide Thegen Zilkanett’s efforts and ensure their insights are integrated into the broader product strategy.&lt;SEP&gt;An executive at Zastama Industries to whom Thegen Zilkanett reports.&lt;SEP&gt;Thikama Harlurine is a Data Scientist who supports the integration of data retention tools for Project Ralamel.&lt;SEP&gt;A supervisor of Thegen Zilkanett, monitoring the progress of Project Sankonen and initiating contingency planning for potential delays.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-002-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-012-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-038-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-064-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-075-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-079-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-109-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-002&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-012&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-038&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-064&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-075&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-079&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-109</data>
      <data key="d5">1793666321</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Fozola Applied Research Lab">
      <data key="d0">Fozola Applied Research Lab</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Fozola Applied Research Lab is a research organization within Zastama Industries, primarily focused on the development and exploration of new materials and technologies to support the company’s long-term strategic goals. The lab is known for its work on scalable data architectures and the development of data retention tooling, which is nearing the stabilization phase of its development. In addition, it conducts high-priority simulations related to material behavior under extreme conditions, a task that has recently faced challenges due to a slowdown in knowledge transfer following the departure of a senior researcher.

Located at the Vurlekri Annex, the lab is currently the subject of internal discussions concerning space requirements, operational efficiency, and integration with broader company systems. As a department within Zastama Industries, it also owns and manages Project Drugilett, and is responsible for overseeing Project Stukoett and Project Vatuen. Furthermore, the Fozola Applied Research Lab has provided support to the Trehaett Applied Research Lab in refining the tooling architecture for Project Monnoheor, highlighting its collaborative role within the company’s research ecosystem.&lt;SEP&gt;A research organization working on the Sestan Loom and the Lozenor Lattice, contributing to the company's innovation and research strategy.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-002-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-028-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-041-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-045-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-061-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-073-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-084-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-119-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-034-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-002&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-028&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-041&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-045&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-061&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-073&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-084&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-119&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-034</data>
      <data key="d5">1793759058</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Zastama Industries">
      <data key="d0">Zastama Industries</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Zastama Industries is a multinational company engaged in a wide range of strategic, operational, and technological initiatives across multiple departments and locations. As a parent organization, it oversees several campuses, including the Pozoine Campus, Lardoel Campus, Gahikron Campus, and Vurlekri Annex, as well as research labs such as the Thellusen Applied Research Lab, Gekreine Applied Research Lab, and Lozeine Applied Research Lab. These facilities support innovation in areas such as infrastructure development, cybersecurity, data science, and warehouse automation.

The company is actively managing numerous high-impact projects, including Project Zelpan, Project Sankonen, Project Daslalett, Project Golgoett, Project Statugoan, and Project Tinpia, among others. These initiatives are aligned with Zastama Industries’ strategic goals of operational efficiency, innovation, and cross-functional collaboration. The company emphasizes the importance of internal systems integration, secure access protocols, and compliance with both internal and external standards. It also maintains strong vendor relationships, working with partners such as Kavafa Systems, Stevosdim Partners, and Zitrien Partners.

Zastama Industries employs a diverse workforce, including key personnel such as Dreto Zampusrar, Megen Tissefam, Krilfia Mukela, and Zonvor Dirnasor, who contribute to leadership, finance, infrastructure, and project management. The company regularly conducts strategic reviews, operational planning meetings, and internal status reports to monitor progress and ensure alignment with long-term objectives. These reviews involve multiple departments, including R&amp;D, operations, finance, and compliance, and are supported by cross-departmental teams such as the Zugula Infrastructure Team, Bomekraen Infrastructure Team, and Drugoan Platform Group.

In addition to its internal operations, Zastama Industries is committed to fostering a collaborative and supportive work environment. It emphasizes transparency, employee recognition, and structured onboarding processes. The company also maintains a focus on data integrity, system resilience, and secure infrastructure, particularly in projects involving identity and access management, fleet telemetry, and analytics. With a strong emphasis on innovation and operational excellence, Zastama Industries continues to evolve its strategic direction to meet the demands of its expanding portfolio and market presence.</data>
