    <node id="Process Optimization">
      <data key="d0">Process Optimization</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The focus of the cross-departmental meeting to improve coordination and efficiency between departments.&lt;SEP&gt;The effort to eliminate redundancies and improve workflow across departments to enhance efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;An initiative undertaken by the team of Project Vomkolel to enhance efficiency in upcoming phases.&lt;SEP&gt;A focus area at Zastama Industries to streamline decision-making and reduce duplication of effort across departments.&lt;SEP&gt;A service provided by Bekuine Consulting to improve the efficiency of Zastama Industries' operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Process Optimization is a strategic goal for Zastama Industries, focusing on reducing redundancies and improving interdepartmental coordination.</data>
