    <node id="Natrala Relay">
      <data key="d0">Natrala Relay</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A critical infrastructure initiative hosted at the Pozoine Campus, currently in the final phase of infrastructure deployment and preparing for system testing and activation.&lt;SEP&gt;A critical infrastructure component hosted at the Pozoine Campus, supporting internal communication and data routing.&lt;SEP&gt;A critical component of Zastama Industries' infrastructure. It is hosted at the Pozoine Campus and is maintained and optimized by a dedicated team.&lt;SEP&gt;A project being developed by the Zugula Infrastructure Team. It is currently undergoing testing and is expected to meet or exceed early projections in signal integrity and throughput capacity.&lt;SEP&gt;The Natrala Relay is a key component in the infrastructure suite of Zastama Industries. It is the focus of enhancements through Project Lovulett to improve performance and reliability.</data>
