    <node id="Stevosdim Partners">
      <data key="d0">Stevosdim Partners</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A vendor providing component delivery and system integration services for the Hunbenan Beacon under a 12-month master services agreement.&lt;SEP&gt;A long-standing collaborator of Zastama Industries, providing specialized support in system integration and process optimization. They are currently supporting both Project Kanponan and Project Zelpan.&lt;SEP&gt;A partner organization with which Zastama Industries is collaborating on Project Zelpan. They are involved in defining deliverables and evolving requirements for the project.&lt;SEP&gt;An external partner with whom Zastama Industries has a services contract for Project Zelpan.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-051-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-068-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-095-chunk-000</data>
