    </node>
    <node id="Bekuine Consulting">
      <data key="d0">Bekuine Consulting</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Bekuine Consulting is a consulting firm engaged by Zastama Industries under a 24-month master services agreement. The firm provides specialized expertise in areas such as process optimization, risk assessment, strategic planning, and alignment with strategic priorities. It plays a key role in the company's analytics and advisory work and is currently delivering value under the terms of this agreement. The contract is set to expire at the end of Q3 FY27 and is under evaluation for renewal, with a decision expected in the third quarter of the fiscal year. 

In addition to this primary engagement, Bekuine Consulting holds a separate contract with Zastama Industries valued at $8.6M. This contract supports the development of the Petoine Console and is managed independently of the Mumteror Prism initiative. It is currently under review for compliance with internal procurement guidelines and financial tracking requirements. This contract is also part of Project Sankonen and is being assessed for alignment with the company’s strategic direction.

The firm has also delivered equipment to the Lardoel Campus for the Hunbenan Beacon and is currently under contract renewal evaluation for continued support. The performance of Bekuine Consulting is being closely evaluated, with alternatives for the executive team being considered by June 30, 2026.&lt;SEP&gt;An external consulting firm collaborating with Zastama Industries on the delivery of new equipment to the Lardoel Campus.&lt;SEP&gt;A consulting firm under a 24-month master services agreement, providing support for multiple high-priority engagements.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-028-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-078-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-087-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-088-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-092-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-092-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-101-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-112-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-000-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-023-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-036-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-097-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-037-chunk-000</data>
