    <node id="Dretho Stopasel">
      <data key="d0">Dretho Stopasel</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">An individual who has maintained strong collaboration with Pezuor Sarlenen across teams to ensure strategic objectives are met.&lt;SEP&gt;A member of Zastama Industries' management structure who is receiving reports from Thikama Harlurine as part of an effort to streamline internal communications and improve decision-making speed.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual who has requested support from the Thellusen Applied Research Lab for cross-functional initiatives and is involved in team well-being strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;A senior manager at Zastama Industries who reports to Pezuor Sarlenen and has been focused on streamlining communication between departments and ensuring alignment on cross-functional objectives.&lt;SEP&gt;Dretho Stopasel is a person who leads or oversees Project Ralamel and communicates with the team regarding budget and project updates.&lt;SEP&gt;A member of the Genfinel Platform Group who joined the company in 2023 and is instrumental in driving the strategic direction of Project Porkuine.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual to whom Relhael Thunmam now reports directly, providing guidance and support to ensure strategic objectives are met.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-012-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-015-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-071-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-079-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-106-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-113-chunk-000</data>
