    <node id="Pezuor Sarlenen">
      <data key="d0">Pezuor Sarlenen</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">An individual who has maintained strong collaboration with Dretho Stopasel across teams to ensure strategic objectives are met.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual who has requested support from the Thellusen Applied Research Lab for cross-functional initiatives and is involved in team well-being strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;A senior manager at Zastama Industries to whom Dretho Stopasel reports.&lt;SEP&gt;A key member of the operations leadership at Zastama Industries, focusing on warehouse automation and participating in the Drurlomis Integration Team.</data>
