    <node id="Q2 FY27">
      <data key="d0">Q2 FY27</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The second quarter of fiscal year 27, during which the progress of the Hunbenan Beacon and Natrala Relay was reported.&lt;SEP&gt;The second quarter of fiscal year 27, during which the Lozenor Lattice is expected to launch and a customer feedback loop will be initiated.&lt;SEP&gt;Q2 FY27 is the fiscal quarter in which Project Medeis is scheduled to be completed.&lt;SEP&gt;The target completion date for Project Medeis.</data>
