      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">An individual leading an initiative to improve customer onboarding flows across Zastama Industries.&lt;SEP&gt;A representative at Zastama Industries who oversees Project Sankonen and provides updates on its staffing and progress.&lt;SEP&gt;A leader in the research and development (R&amp;D) department at Zastama Industries who oversees a range of exploratory and applied research projects.&lt;SEP&gt;A member of the leadership team who oversees Project Loloman and has expressed confidence in the team's ability to deliver on time and within budget.&lt;SEP&gt;A strategic leader at Zastama Industries who provides oversight and direction to ensure technical goals align with broader company objectives.&lt;SEP&gt;Novoran Trabrelor is an individual who attended the Q2 Strategic Review and Operational Planning Meeting. He is based at the Lardoel Campus and raised concerns about integration delays with an external vendor.</data>
