    <node id="Vurlekri Annex">
      <data key="d0">Vurlekri Annex</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Vurlekri Annex is an operational site of Zastama Industries, located in the northern region and central to the company's logistical framework. It serves as a hub of innovation and progress, where key personnel lead their teams and ongoing developments are conducted. The site has exceeded initial productivity expectations and is the location where Givien Mubren is based. It also functions as the base for Fozuen Runpaor and supports remote operations as a satellite hub for several ongoing projects.

The Vurlekri Annex receives equipment deliveries from multiple vendors, including Nazuel Systems, which supplies equipment used by Zastama Industries for its operations. It is also a site where Votirmi Tresbior is based and where prototype testing for automation systems is conducted. Additionally, the facility houses the Fozola Applied Research Lab and the Daslaor Applied Research Lab, with a total seating capacity of 360 and approximately 85% occupancy. It is a key location for discussions on space usage and real estate costs.

Hethe Potannuel and Zodoine Vemdaen are coordinating operations at the Vurlekri Annex, though they are currently facing minor staffing issues due to a local hiring freeze. Nasomel Sonmerett and their team are also based there, working on the services contract for Project Golgoett. Furthermore, a team or department at the annex is involved in the development of the Sestan Loom for Project Laboel.&lt;SEP&gt;A location where the Lozenor Lattice is hosted, providing a secure and scalable environment for research.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-003-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-005-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-017-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-033-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-061-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-074-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-092-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-116-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-117-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-020-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-055-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-037-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-034-chunk-000</data>
