    <node id="Sallama Lattice">
      <data key="d0">Sallama Lattice</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The location where Project Thibelan is being built.&lt;SEP&gt;A groundbreaking computational model developed by the Trehaett Applied Research Lab, serving as the foundation for Project Thibelan and planned for a Q3 FY26 launch.&lt;SEP&gt;A foundational component of Zastama Industries' operational infrastructure. It is supported by components supplied by Puzeris Systems and is essential for handling increased data throughput and system scalability.&lt;SEP&gt;A product with approximately 3,900 active users, primarily targeting mid-market clients. It is seen as a critical platform and is undergoing improvements in onboarding and feature adoption to increase user retention.&lt;SEP&gt;An internal innovation platform used for interdepartmental coordination and knowledge sharing, with approximately 3,900 active users.</data>
