    <node id="Rekuen Telnelen">
      <data key="d0">Rekuen Telnelen</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">An individual who has been working at Zastama Industries since 2021, focusing on fleet telemetry and introducing systems that improve operational visibility and data-driven decision-making.&lt;SEP&gt;Rekuen Telnelen provides financial and operational oversight for the Zasdaett Harbor initiative, managing the cost center GF-7944-E to track expenditures and resource allocations.&lt;SEP&gt;Rekuen Telnelen is a Product Manager who communicates with the Security Operations Team regarding access badge and procurement order details for Project Barkil.&lt;SEP&gt;A Product Manager with access badge series JK-3480-U, who provided updates on the Donnoett Loom, raised concerns about access control, and will lead user engagement and feature prioritization efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;The Product Manager overseeing relevant initiatives at Zastama Industries. Involved in providing input on the appropriateness of Mominen Dosalen's cost center assignment and operational needs.</data>
