    <node id="Fleet Telemetry Systems">
      <data key="d0">Fleet Telemetry Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">system</data>
      <data key="d2">A set of systems introduced by Rekuen Telnelen to improve operational visibility and data-driven decision-making for fleet management.&lt;SEP&gt;A system used by Zastama Industries to ensure smooth operations and quick response to anomalies or performance issues.&lt;SEP&gt;Systems developed under Project Serinen to monitor and improve operational efficiency across all fleet assets.&lt;SEP&gt;A system used for monitoring and collecting data from vehicle fleets, which is the primary focus of Project Krabehien and Dopusa Varesett's work.&lt;SEP&gt;Systems used for the integration and analysis of data from Zastama Industries’ mobile and remote assets.&lt;SEP&gt;A set of systems used for monitoring and managing fleet operations, with which the Maslarine Compass is being integrated to ensure compatibility and operational continuity.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-003-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-067-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-087-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-013-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-035-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-053-chunk-000</data>
