      <data key="d5">1793759768</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Innovation">
      <data key="d0">Innovation</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Innovation is a core value and strategic focus at Zastama Industries, emphasized across multiple departments and initiatives as a key driver of progress, adaptability, and success. It is described as a central goal that fosters a culture of continuous improvement and the generation of new ideas. This value is reflected in the company’s strategic objectives, initiatives, and mission, and is supported through cross-project collaboration, the integration of telemetry and data science methods, and the development of new tools, models, and features to enhance operational efficiency.

Innovation is actively promoted through employee engagement, leadership, and cross-departmental collaboration. It is a focus area balanced with risk management in key projects and is supported by various internal teams and labs, including the Lozeine Applied Research Lab, the Thellusen Applied Research Lab, the Fozola Applied Research Lab, the Drurlomis Integration Team, and the Drugoan Platform Group. These entities work to drive new developments, platform capabilities, and research-based solutions. Specific projects, such as Project Sankonen and Project Monnoheor, exemplify the company’s commitment to innovation.

Additionally, innovation is a focus area for the Stonfe Analytics Unit, where it is maintained alongside operational efficiency. The concept is also outlined as a strategic priority in the Q3 Operational Status Report, underscoring its importance in the company’s ongoing operations and future direction. Overall, innovation is deeply embedded in Zastama Industries’ culture and is seen as essential to achieving long-term success and maintaining a competitive edge.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-003-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-038-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-043-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-049-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-071-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-076-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-078-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-077-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-086-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-093-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-113-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-117-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-020-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-089-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-007-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-026-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-027-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-070-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-034-chunk-000</data>
