    <node id="Customer Satisfaction">
      <data key="d0">Customer Satisfaction</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A core goal of Zastama Industries, aimed at ensuring the needs and expectations of customers are met.&lt;SEP&gt;A core value of Zastama Industries that is reflected in the company's commitment to delivering secure, scalable, and user-friendly enterprise solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;A strategic goal of Zastama Industries, supported by both the Drurlomis Integration Team and the Drugoan Platform Group, to ensure that systems and processes meet the highest standards of performance and reliability.&lt;SEP&gt;A goal at Zastama Industries, improved through enhanced onboarding processes led by Siduris Pirpoan.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-003-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-043-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-086-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-027-chunk-000</data>
