      <data key="d0">Trikria Drazorel</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A senior executive at Zastama Industries who leads the operations review meeting and oversees key projects and departments.&lt;SEP&gt;A contributor to Project Stukoett, offering insights on incident response tooling and incident response protocols.&lt;SEP&gt;Trikria Drazorel is a leader to whom Givien Mubren now reports and is involved in cross-functional integration efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;A team leader at Zastama Industries who is leading the development of new incident response tools and focuses on incident response tooling.</data>
