      <data key="d2">A list of specific tasks assigned to individuals or teams following the Zastama Industries operations review meeting.&lt;SEP&gt;Action Items are specific tasks assigned to individuals following the Q3 Strategic Review and Operational Planning Meeting to ensure follow-up and implementation of decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;A list of specific tasks assigned to various departments and individuals following the strategic planning meeting.&lt;SEP&gt;A set of tasks assigned to teams for execution by specific deadlines to advance Project Monnoheor.&lt;SEP&gt;Action Items are specific tasks assigned during the meeting to be completed by certain individuals or teams by specified deadlines.&lt;SEP&gt;A list of tasks assigned to individuals following the meeting to ensure project progress and coordination.&lt;SEP&gt;A list of tasks assigned during the meeting for follow-up and implementation by various participants.</data>
