      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A team coordinator who joined Zastama Industries in 2018. They have been central to coordinating cross-functional teams for the development of new internal tools, improving communication and efficiency across departments.&lt;SEP&gt;A UX Researcher at Zastama Industries, supporting multiple initiatives through user studies and usability testing. Their work is particularly valuable in Project Kanponan and contributes to cross-functional teams by providing insights into design and user experience.&lt;SEP&gt;An attendee of the Q2 FY27 Strategic Review and Project Alignment Meeting, who has been with Zastama Industries since 2018 and emphasized the importance of retaining key talent.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual tasked with leading the development of a mentorship program, supported by HR, with a pilot launch scheduled for Q3 FY27.&lt;SEP&gt;A professional working on demand forecasting models and coordinating with other teams for Project Minkegais.&lt;SEP&gt;Drestoa Hasgaor is a UX Researcher who participated in the meeting and proposed integrating demand forecasting models into customer onboarding flows.</data>
