      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Selnaor Padroa reports to Soramis Nolaor and is involved in cross-functional integration efforts related to Project Velbirum.&lt;SEP&gt;A member of the Kratavaen Infrastructure Team who outlined upcoming phases of infrastructure upgrades.&lt;SEP&gt;A valued member of Zastama Industries since 2014, instrumental in the development and maintenance of long-term financial systems for cost center tracking.&lt;SEP&gt;An employee with extensive experience in Zastama’s legacy systems, now in a secondary oversight role for Project Ruzonine.&lt;SEP&gt;An employee of Zastama Industries, Inc. who has been with the company since 2014 and provided background on financial systems during a transition period.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual who initiated the discussion by referencing audit findings and highlighting discrepancies in access logs.&lt;SEP&gt;The Operations Manager at Zastama Industries, who has been instrumental in managing the coordination of multiple initiatives and improving interdepartmental communication.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-088-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-096-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-013-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-015-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-031-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-054-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-004-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-088&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-096&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-013&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-015&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-031&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-054&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-004</data>
