      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Finance Department">
      <data key="d0">Finance Department</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Finance Department is a key department within Zastama Industries responsible for managing the company's financial activities, including financial planning, budgeting, and reporting. It plays a central role in ensuring financial compliance and coordinating with various internal and external stakeholders, such as the compliance team and vendors. The department is also tasked with providing financial oversight and resource allocation, currently led by Soramis Nolaor.

The Finance Department supports cross-functional initiatives within Zastama Industries, such as Project Stukoett and the Zartesis Prism, by facilitating timely collaboration essential to their success. It works closely with the contract management team to ensure accurate reporting for specific projects, including the Mumteror Prism. Additionally, the department collaborates with the Krodroan Infrastructure Team to align forecasting models with strategic resource planning.

In the context of the Nomzamel Lattice, the Finance Department manages the financial aspects of the initiative, further demonstrating its role in coordinating and supporting complex, multi-departmental projects across the organization.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-064-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-065-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-009-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-000-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-025-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-051-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-052-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-000-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-081-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-027-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-004-chunk-000</data>
