    <node id="Q3">
      <data key="d0">Q3</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The third quarter of the year, during which Zastama Industries produced an operational status report summarizing progress in key operational domains.&lt;SEP&gt;Q3 refers to the third quarter of the fiscal year, during which budget reviews and financial reconciliations are being conducted.&lt;SEP&gt;The third quarter of the fiscal year, during which the Lozeine Applied Research Lab plans to submit a pilot project proposal to the manufacturing team and finalize Project Zelpan's demand forecasting models.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-093-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-011-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-004-chunk-000</data>
