    <node id="Strategic Alignment">
      <data key="d0">Strategic Alignment</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A focus area for Zastama Industries to ensure that all departments and projects are in line with broader business objectives and risk management strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;The coordination of individual and team efforts with the broader objectives of Zastama Industries.&lt;SEP&gt;Strategic Alignment refers to the process of ensuring that all teams and initiatives are in line with the company's overarching strategic goals.&lt;SEP&gt;A priority at Zastama Industries, ensuring that all departments are working toward shared objectives.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-012-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-020-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-059-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-027-chunk-000</data>
