    <node id="Resource Planning">
      <data key="d0">Resource Planning</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A process being aligned with strategic priorities at Zastama Industries to ensure efficient allocation of resources across initiatives.&lt;SEP&gt;Resource Planning refers to the process of allocating and managing resources for Q3 planning and execution.&lt;SEP&gt;Resource Planning is a method used by Zastama Industries to allocate and manage resources for the coastal region, informed by reports from the Krafuline Field Office.&lt;SEP&gt;A method used by Zastama Industries to ensure effective coordination and allocation of resources. It is a focus of the Strategic Operations Oversight Team's communication.&lt;SEP&gt;Resource Planning is a method used by the Finance Team to support Project Barkil and ensure adequate allocation of resources.&lt;SEP&gt;A strategic activity at Zastama Industries, particularly aligned with the demand forecasting models being developed in Project Zelpan.</data>
