    <node id="Gobena Hoszesine">
      <data key="d0">Gobena Hoszesine</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">An employee of Zastama Industries who leads the technical implementation of Project Tinpia and joined the company in 2019.&lt;SEP&gt;Gobena Hoszesine is a key contributor to the Zugula Infrastructure Team, focusing on identity and access management. Their work ensures that internal systems and data remain secure with appropriate access controls and authentication protocols.&lt;SEP&gt;Gobena Hoszesine is a team member who joined the company in 2019 and focuses on identity and access tooling. They initiated a discussion on access and identity protocols for Project Velbirum.&lt;SEP&gt;An employee at Zastama Industries who reports to Holol Kareman and provided a detailed status update on Project Monnoheor's fieldwork.&lt;SEP&gt;Gobena Hoszesine is responsible for identity and access tooling. Her work has been vital in ensuring systems remain secure and compliant with internal policies, particularly in relation to the Natrala Relay.</data>
