    <node id="Project Tinpia">
      <data key="d0">Project Tinpia</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A project at Zastama Industries targeting completion in Q1 FY26, with a focus on meeting key milestones and requiring cross-departmental coordination.&lt;SEP&gt;A project in its second development phase, led by Broteor Pikrisen, with Kragura Stenmori managing day-to-day execution and coordination with the Zoluna Data Center.&lt;SEP&gt;A high-priority initiative focused on enhancing system reliability and scalability across multiple internal platforms at Zastama Industries. It is currently on track for completion in Q1 FY26 and is being spearheaded by Broteor Pikrisen.&lt;SEP&gt;Project Tinpia is a project that has received an approved budget of $8.2M. It is mentioned in the context of budget reallocations and their impact on resource planning for other projects.&lt;SEP&gt;An infrastructure project being managed by the Krodroan Infrastructure Team with an approved budget of $8.2M and a focus on improving scalability and reducing maintenance costs.</data>
