    <node id="Project Management Office">
      <data key="d0">Project Management Office</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A department at Zastama Industries responsible for managing and coordinating projects.&lt;SEP&gt;The office responsible for coordinating project management activities, including status updates, resource reallocation considerations, and communication with stakeholders.&lt;SEP&gt;The department responsible for overseeing Project Zasmemine, coordinating compliance efforts, and providing updates to senior management.</data>
