    <node id="Operations Team">
      <data key="d0">Operations Team</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Operations Team is a department within Zastama Industries responsible for a wide range of operational functions, including the management and execution of key projects, the development of contingency plans, and the optimization of system performance. The team collaborates with various internal and external stakeholders, such as Desgua Stebela to identify departments for tooling expansion, Vambi Herganen to enhance telemetry systems and optimize fleet operations, and the Daslaor Applied Research Lab to define the scope of predictive modeling in supply chain optimization. 

The Operations Team is also involved in cross-functional discussions with the engineering team to identify process improvements and works closely with the logistics team to ensure milestones are met for projects such as Project Domesis and Project Lathonel. They play a critical role in confirming the compatibility of Zasdaett Harbor’s new facilities with the logistics and deployment requirements of the Dronmeman Beacon and will conduct an audit of project documentation. Additionally, the team is responsible for managing and reviewing operational logs and performance metrics from the Krafuline Field Office and for ensuring the timely delivery of key projects in alignment with company objectives.

The team is further engaged in the oversight and renewal evaluation of Radesan Consulting and provides feedback on IAM initiatives, highlighting the need for additional integration planning. They are responsible for managing infrastructure components for Project Zasmemine and for confirming that all elements are secured prior to implementation. The Operations Team also plays a role in the logistics of key distribution for Project Lathonel and is involved in the operational aspects of Project Ruzonine. Their input is critical in determining the viability of continuing with the existing framework or pivoting to an adjusted approach for Project Kifevoett. 

Internally, the Operations Team is led by Pivoine Geltoett, who oversees internal development and training programs. The team also collaborates with the finance team to manage project expenditures and ensure operational efficiency, and the Zizadal Infrastructure Team requires closer coordination with them for operational support and handover.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-008-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-043-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-049-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-068-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-071-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-085-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-111-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-025-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-048-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-054-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-018-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-019-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-047-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-052-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-014-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-019-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-050-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-035-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-008&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-043&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-049&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-068&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-071&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-085&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-111&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-001&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-025&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-048&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-054&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-018&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-019&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-047&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-052&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-001&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-014&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-019&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-050&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-035</data>
      <data key="d5">1793759330</data>
