    </node>
    <node id="Leadership Team">
      <data key="d0">Leadership Team</data>
      <data key="d1">group</data>
      <data key="d2">The Leadership Team of Zastama Industries is the executive body responsible for guiding the company’s strategic direction, overseeing key initiatives, and ensuring alignment with long-term goals. This group is tasked with strategic planning, resource allocation, and fostering a culture of collaboration and innovation across departments. Members of the team communicate strategic priorities to all levels of the organization and monitor progress on key performance indicators, such as those for the fiscal year 2026 (FY26).

In addition to strategic oversight, the Leadership Team reviews enterprise-wide risk assessments to identify opportunities for optimization and efficiency improvements. They are also involved in evaluating specific projects, such as Project Dremtona, to determine the best course of action for enhancing performance. The team includes high-level executives such as Gonnom Gosmunza, who plays a key role in ensuring that organizational initiatives remain aligned with broader strategic objectives.

As the central decision-making body, the Leadership Team is responsible for enterprise-wide communication, ensuring that strategic direction is clearly conveyed to all employees. Their role encompasses both high-level planning and operational oversight, making them a critical component of Zastama Industries’ governance and success.&lt;SEP&gt;The team within Zastama Industries providing support to ensure the success of both projects.</data>
