    <node id="Cross-Functional Team">
      <data key="d0">Cross-Functional Team</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A team led by Nilbapo Fivasor to review and refine the payments reconciliation process.&lt;SEP&gt;The team assigned to oversee final preparations for the Donnoett Loom project, including Lenhoa Trakrean.&lt;SEP&gt;A team at Zastama Industries tasked with overseeing the pilot deployment phase of the Dambune Panarnoel initiative to ensure technical and operational requirements are met.&lt;SEP&gt;A group of individuals from different departments or areas of expertise within the Gekreine Applied Research Lab, working together on a specific project phase.</data>
