      <data key="d2">A key personnel member based at the Pozoine Campus, serving as the Procurement Manager responsible for overseeing the acquisition of materials and services.&lt;SEP&gt;A team leader at Zastama Industries who is refining predictive models for demand forecasting and is being supported by Pobraor Tosaett.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual based at the Pozoine Campus who has been instrumental in leading recent advancements in Zastama Industries' infrastructure strategy.</data>
