    <node id="Talgal Trozien">
      <data key="d0">Talgal Trozien</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A key personnel member based at the Pozoine Campus, integral to operations but with specific roles to be detailed in broader internal communications.&lt;SEP&gt;Talgal Trozien is the lead for the fleet telemetry initiative. They are working closely with the engineering and operations teams to refine data collection and analysis processes.&lt;SEP&gt;The leader of Project Serinen, responsible for driving progress on the development of fleet telemetry systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Based at the Pozoine Campus, this individual provided insights into the logistics of deploying infrastructure components and coordinated with the facilities coordinator.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-009-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-085-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-087-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-021-chunk-000</data>
