    <node id="Drurlomis Integration Team">
      <data key="d0">Drurlomis Integration Team</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Drurlomis Integration Team is a cross-functional group within Zastama Industries, based at the Pozoine Campus, that is responsible for ensuring the seamless integration of new technologies and systems into the company's existing infrastructure. The team's primary focus is on aligning and synchronizing data and access systems across departments, promoting operational efficiency and cross-departmental collaboration. It plays a central role in supporting Zastama Industries’ technical agility and innovation.

The team is involved in a variety of integration-focused activities, including the management of several key projects such as Project Drannen, Project Hamuis, and Project Vatuen. It operates on an annual budget of $8.3 million, reflecting its strategic importance to the company. The team is led by Sotroa Veriris and includes active participants such as Gudrosa Ganema. In addition to internal system integration, the Drurlomis Integration Team also works to align internal systems with external partnerships, further enhancing the company's operational and technological capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;A team within Zastama Industries working on the development and integration of the Broltala Loom.&lt;SEP&gt;A team of 25 members working on the Tanumett Relay project, responsible for its development and integration.&lt;SEP&gt;A team within Zastama Industries working on integration efforts that intersect with the Genfinel Platform Group's work.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-009-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-044-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-074-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-075-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-073-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-077-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-080-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-086-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-095-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-114-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-098-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-009&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-044&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-074&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-075&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-073&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-077&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-080&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-086&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-095&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-114&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-098</data>
      <data key="d5">1793701171</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Burteor Vudiren">
      <data key="d0">Burteor Vudiren</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">An official member of the Drurlomis Integration Team, contributing to the integration of new systems and protocols.&lt;SEP&gt;The head of the Trehaett Applied Research Lab, who reports directly to Geszea Tonzamnel and leads the lab's innovative efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;A core member of the Drurlomis Integration Team who joined Zastama Industries in 2013. Burteor Vudiren guides the team in evaluating and implementing integration strategies and contributes to strategic planning and risk assessments.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual who reports to Geszea Tonzamnel and has observed minor latency patterns during peak load periods for the Garelor Relay. They are offering insights on load balancing and redundancy protocols for the task force.&lt;SEP&gt;A senior field researcher based at the Lelosis Field Office, whose work spans multiple projects and contributes significantly to the success of field-based studies.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-009-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-053-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-086-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-094-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-007-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-009&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-053&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-086&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-094&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-007</data>
      <data key="d5">1793699620</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Hurpuman Partners">
      <data key="d0">Hurpuman Partners</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A trusted vendor collaborating with Zastama Industries, currently supplying components for the Broltala Loom.&lt;SEP&gt;A company that collaborates with Zastama Industries on the delivery of components for the Broltala Loom and has an active services contract for Project Porkuine.&lt;SEP&gt;An external partner with whom the Thellusen Applied Research Lab has a services contract for Project Vomkolel.&lt;SEP&gt;A service provider supporting Project Daslalett under a formal services contract. It collaborates with the Kratavaen Infrastructure Team.&lt;SEP&gt;Hurpuman Partners is a company with which Zastama Industries has a services contract for Project Daslalett. They are being kept informed of the project's status through weekly calls.&lt;SEP&gt;Hurpuman Partners is a long-standing vendor of Zastama Industries, operating under a 18-month master services agreement. It is responsible for delivering equipment to the Thamhuor Campus and is involved in Project Gadramor through a services contract.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-009-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-011-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-015-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-019-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-033-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-036-chunk-000</data>
