    <node id="Broltala Loom">
      <data key="d0">Broltala Loom</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A core element of Zastama Industries' production line, for which Hurpuman Partners supplies components.&lt;SEP&gt;A project or system for which Hurpuman Partners delivers components, and which is a focus of Zastama Industries' operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Broltala Loom is a division within the company that is supporting Project Statugoan. It is also involved in an integration with Project Daslalett, which could indirectly impact Project Statugoan's onboarding processes.&lt;SEP&gt;A system or device being developed by the Drurlomis Integration Team, integral to the success of Project Daslalett.&lt;SEP&gt;A system hosted at the Lelosis Field Office, operating within expected parameters and undergoing routine maintenance.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-009-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-011-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-052-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-095-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-081-chunk-000</data>
