      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Integration">
      <data key="d0">Integration</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The process of incorporating new systems and protocols into existing infrastructure, managed by the Drurlomis Integration Team.&lt;SEP&gt;Integration is a method used at Zastama Industries to combine telemetry data and data science insights. It is seen as a way to enhance scalability and adaptability to market demands.&lt;SEP&gt;A process to combine the Bankis Compass with the Ketemram Vault to enhance functionality and user experience.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of connecting different systems or processes to work together seamlessly. A key concern is the integration between the Fozola Applied Research Lab's systems and the broader Zastama Industries platform.&lt;SEP&gt;A requirement for the new tools to work seamlessly with the Kusbosine Console.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of ensuring seamless compatibility between systems, such as the Zathunel Beacon and Project Vomkolel.&lt;SEP&gt;A process involving the incorporation of the Ketemram Vault into both Project Monnoheor and Project Pomtorgi to enhance their capabilities.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-009-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-038-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-050-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-061-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-054-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-070-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-034-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-009&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-038&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-050&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-061&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-054&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-070&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-034</data>
      <data key="d5">1793759058</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Vendor Relationship">
      <data key="d0">Vendor Relationship</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The collaborative relationship between Zastama Industries and its vendors, such as Hurpuman Partners, to maintain product quality and reliability.&lt;SEP&gt;The collaborative partnership between Zastama Industries and Nedroran Fabrication for Project Vatuen, managed through defined agreements and regular performance reviews.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-009-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-031-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-009&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-031</data>
