      <data key="d0">Data Collection</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A process of gathering and managing data, particularly for projects at the Krafuline Field Office.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of gathering information from the field, which is essential for analysis and decision-making in Zastama Industries' operations.</data>
