    <node id="Data Integration">
      <data key="d0">Data Integration</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A technical field in which specialized expertise is currently in short supply, posing a risk to the Thellusen Applied Research Lab's operations.&lt;SEP&gt;One of the two primary focus areas of Project Ralamel, involving the integration of telemetry data and real-time monitoring capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;A core function of the Nunvaine Lattice platform, used by teams previously reliant on alternative systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Data Integration is a concept being enhanced by the Dronmeman Beacon to improve the consolidation and accessibility of data across the organization.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of combining data from various sources to create a unified view, a key focus of Project Lovulett.</data>
