      <data key="d0">Actionable Insights</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Valuable information generated by Project Sankonen that supports decision-making and operational improvements.&lt;SEP&gt;Insights generated by the Stonfe Analytics Unit that are useful for decision-making.&lt;SEP&gt;Information derived from data analysis that can be used to make informed decisions, a key output of the Sabrinett Analytics Unit.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-071-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-026-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-007-chunk-000</data>
