      <data key="d0">Data Modeling</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A process used by the Sabrinett Analytics Unit to structure and organize data for analysis and business operations.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of structuring and analyzing data to support decision-making, a key activity of the Sabrinett Analytics Unit.&lt;SEP&gt;A process used by the Sabrinett Analytics Unit to support Project Krindais with predictive insights.</data>
