      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A process led by Pobraor Tosaett to evaluate the insights generated by demand forecasting models and ensure they are actionable.&lt;SEP&gt;A core function of the Nunvaine Lattice platform, used by teams previously reliant on alternative systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The examination of data to extract insights and support decision-making, a core function of the Sabrinett Analytics Unit.</data>
