    <node id="Project Porkuine">
      <data key="d0">Project Porkuine</data>
      <data key="d1">project</data>
      <data key="d2">A services contract with Hurpuman Partners, focused on the timely and quality delivery of components for the Broltala Loom.&lt;SEP&gt;A high-priority development initiative built on the Tusgagiel Ledger, focused on enhancing data integrity and access controls for Zastama Industries' internal systems.&lt;SEP&gt;A project under the ownership and development of the Genfinel Platform Group, with cross-campus collaboration efforts.</data>
