    <node id="Legal Team">
      <data key="d0">Legal Team</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A group within Zastama Industries responsible for contract reviews, risk mitigation, and ensuring legal compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;The team responsible for providing legal summaries and ensuring compliance for Project Zelpan.&lt;SEP&gt;A group responsible for reviewing compliance documentation and raising questions about the status of the escrow agreement for the Kralinan Data Center.&lt;SEP&gt;A team within the company responsible for reviewing and finalizing contracts, including the one with Brepemrir Logistics for Project Krabinel.&lt;SEP&gt;The internal team at Zastama Industries reviewing the contract with Gibasan Logistics for compliance with procurement policies.&lt;SEP&gt;The team responsible for ensuring all documentation related to the Vonnusett Lattice's escrow is accessible and up to date for internal review.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-011-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-039-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-022-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-028-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-036-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-043-chunk-000</data>
