    <node id="Initial Findings">
      <data key="d0">Initial Findings</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Initial Findings refer to the preliminary results and insights gathered by Zevus Lokramel regarding the services provided by Puzeris Systems in support of Project Golgoett.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-010-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-010</data>
      <data key="d5">1793655154</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Meeting">
      <data key="d0">Meeting</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Meeting refers to a recurring or scheduled gathering of individuals or groups to discuss specific topics, review progress, or make decisions. These meetings often involve stakeholders, project teams, and departmental representatives to address organizational, operational, or strategic matters. 

One such meeting was held on April 5, 2025, at Zastama Industries, where office space and team realignment were discussed. Attendees included Pinhan Bilfael, Pelzoan Gemefe, Kidasa Branilen, Zonvor Dirnasor, and a finance representative. Another meeting took place on April 2, 2025, to review the status of Project Tinpia and assess the Brapoett Vault's capacity. On April 12, 2024, a discussion focused on the Donnoett Loom, access control, team structure, and user engagement strategies. Additionally, a meeting on April 12, 2023, reviewed the Stonfe Analytics Unit and planned strategic initiatives.

Other instances of meetings include a scheduled event on October 19, 2023, at 14:00 to review updates and next steps, and a gathering involving the Krodroan Infrastructure Team, compliance and legal departments, and project stakeholders to finalize revisions for Project Zelpan. A meeting was also held to align audit findings with current procedures, involving Pethisa Hebroren, Fallem Purraren, Pivoine Geltoett, and the compliance team. Furthermore, a meeting was convened to further discuss the renewal of the Puzeris Systems contract and its implications for the Lardoel Campus and Project Golgoett.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-010-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-039-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-061-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-037-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-037-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-039-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-021-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-026-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-010&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-039&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-061&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-037&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-037&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-039&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-021&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-026</data>
      <data key="d5">1793699145</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Drisfer Ganlanis">
      <data key="d0">Drisfer Ganlanis</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A long-standing employee of Zastama Industries since 2015, serving as a central figure in operations and providing critical support to departments across the organization.&lt;SEP&gt;A leader in the infrastructure and operations division at Zastama Industries since 2015, responsible for building and refining the operational infrastructure that supports product teams.&lt;SEP&gt;A Program Manager at Zastama Industries who coordinates cross-functional teams and reports to Fovaen Zomvesor.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-012-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-014-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-078-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-012&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-014&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-078</data>
      <data key="d5">1793662226</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Gonnom Gosmunza">
      <data key="d0">Gonnom Gosmunza</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A 2023 employee of Zastama Industries who has taken on the role of Director of Engineering, working to align engineering priorities with broader business goals.&lt;SEP&gt;Gonnom Gosmunza is a Director of Engineering who shared updates on engineering initiatives and backend enhancements.&lt;SEP&gt;A member of the Daslaor Applied Research Lab who has collaborated with Hethe Potannuel on a data modeling project.&lt;SEP&gt;A leader in the engineering division of Zastama Industries to whom Thokro Pobris reports, and a member of the leadership team focused on aligning initiatives with long-term strategic goals.&lt;SEP&gt;A person who is coordinating the integration of identity and access tooling for Project Golgoett. They are responsible for ensuring alignment between teams and managing the development sprints.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-012-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-030-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-074-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-076-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-055-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-012&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-030&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-074&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-076&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-055</data>
      <data key="d5">1793694834</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Pinduen Gersolel">
      <data key="d0">Pinduen Gersolel</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">An employee of Zastama Industries who is currently reporting to Liha Medrorel and is focused on optimizing workflows, resource allocation, and performance tracking.&lt;SEP&gt;Pinduen Gersolel is a UX Researcher who joined the company in 2017 and presented an overview of recent developments in identity and access tooling.&lt;SEP&gt;Pinduen Gersolel is an individual who attended the Q2 Strategic Review and Operational Planning Meeting. He reported on internal process optimization initiatives, including a review of cross-team communication and resource allocation, and highlighted the need for clearer reporting structures.&lt;SEP&gt;A team member under Liha Medrorel who is leading the integration of the modular authentication framework with legacy systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-012-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-030-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-104-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-109-chunk-000</data>
