    <node id="Scalable Solutions">
      <data key="d0">Scalable Solutions</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A focus area for Zastama Industries, referring to the development of tools and services that can grow and adapt to client needs.&lt;SEP&gt;A marketing focus for the Krorhitra Console and Sallama Lattice, targeting mid-market clients who require adaptable and expandable product capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;A concept involving the development of technical solutions that can grow and adapt to meet increasing demands. It is a focus of Munnam Furzil's work at Zastama Industries.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-014-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-068-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-056-chunk-000</data>
