    <node id="Thellusen Applied Research Lab">
      <data key="d0">Thellusen Applied Research Lab</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A research laboratory under Zastama Industries, responsible for executing key projects and maintaining innovation and collaboration.&lt;SEP&gt;A dedicated team at Zastama Industries focused on translating emerging research into practical applications that benefit the company.&lt;SEP&gt;The organization that owns and manages Project Lovulett, a project in a critical phase of testing and development.&lt;SEP&gt;A research lab within Zastama Industries that focuses on applied research to drive innovation and has a $1.9M annual budget.&lt;SEP&gt;A research laboratory responsible for developing Project Lovulett and the Krorhitra Console.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-015-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-032-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-063-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-077-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-090-chunk-000</data>
