    <node id="Project Drutoett">
      <data key="d0">Project Drutoett</data>
      <data key="d1">project</data>
      <data key="d2">A core project of the Thellusen Applied Research Lab, aligned with long-term corporate innovation goals and currently in the middle of its research and development cycle.&lt;SEP&gt;An active development project at Zastama Industries with an approved budget of $8.4M. It involves multiple departments and is being regularly reviewed to ensure it remains within budget and timeline.&lt;SEP&gt;Project Drutoett is a high-priority initiative within Zastama Industries, staffed by 39 individuals from multiple departments. Its primary objective is to deliver a secure and scalable infrastructure solution for internal systems. The project operates under a contract and is managed under a cross-functional leadership model with oversight from senior stakeholders in engineering, legal, and procurement.&lt;SEP&gt;A project that is staffed by 39 people and is being coordinated alongside Project Zasmemine for shared resource management.&lt;SEP&gt;A project with a steady staffing level of 39 people. It is being monitored for potential impacts on cross-project collaboration, particularly with Project Krabinel.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-015-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-069-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-014-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-019-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-028-chunk-000</data>
