    <node id="Berruan Zenresan">
      <data key="d0">Berruan Zenresan</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The leader of Project Vomkolel, responsible for maintaining project timelines, deliverables, and coordination with Hurpuman Partners.&lt;SEP&gt;An employee who collaborates with Lithen Brisisel to identify opportunities for streamlining workflows and enhancing internal communication.&lt;SEP&gt;A contributor to the development and implementation of demand forecasting models under Debrol Babroine's guidance.&lt;SEP&gt;The Head of Security at Zastama Industries, who oversees the integration of robust security practices into product development and has been instrumental in strengthening the company's security framework.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-015-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-022-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-087-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-097-chunk-000</data>
