    <node id="Zoluna Data Center">
      <data key="d0">Zoluna Data Center</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">A data center where operations remain stable and within expected parameters, managed by the team based in the river valley region.&lt;SEP&gt;The current hosting location for the Bozilron Ledger. It is the subject of discussions regarding redundancy, capacity, and potential future upgrades.&lt;SEP&gt;A data center located in a river valley region, undergoing a review of its environmental impact and energy usage for long-term sustainability.&lt;SEP&gt;A facility undergoing expansion, supported by equipment shipments from Nilverine Fabrication, with a focus on achieving projected uptime and performance benchmarks.&lt;SEP&gt;A data center that opened in 2023 and supports the Garelor Relay. It is being evaluated for operational readiness, resource allocation, and capacity to support future projects.</data>
