    <node id="Broteor Pikrisen">
      <data key="d0">Broteor Pikrisen</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The leader of Project Tinpia, overseeing its progress and ensuring alignment with strategic objectives.&lt;SEP&gt;A Site Reliability Lead at Zastama Industries since 2013. Broteor Pikrisen is the primary architect of Project Tinpia, responsible for shaping its technical and operational strategy, defining its scope, milestones, and risk mitigation strategies. Broteor Pikrisen also chairs cross-departmental meetings and collaborates closely with Zondila Krerraris.&lt;SEP&gt;A member of the Somhoine Risk Office at Zastama Industries, contributing to cross-functional evaluations of potential operational and financial vulnerabilities.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-016-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-013-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-054-chunk-000</data>
