      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The individual overseeing site operations and system reliability at the Zoluna Data Center and leading infrastructure optimization planning.&lt;SEP&gt;A leader at Zastama Industries who is currently leading efforts in warehouse automation and is a member of the Somhoine Risk Office.&lt;SEP&gt;Relhael Thunmam is a person involved in the governance of Project Ralamel and provides feedback on data governance processes.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual who now reports directly to Dretho Stopasel as part of a leadership structure clarification.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-016-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-054-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-079-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-113-chunk-000</data>
