    <node id="Holol Kareman">
      <data key="d0">Holol Kareman</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The person who has completed infrastructure assessments and implemented adjustments to optimize performance at the Zoluna Data Center.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual who oversees a range of initiatives and product teams within Zastama Industries. Holol Kareman is the manager of Rimoett Dozeine and plays a critical role in coordinating cross-team efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;The head of the Somhoine Risk Office at Zastama Industries, ensuring that risk assessments and mitigation plans align with company policy and regulatory requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;A leader at Zastama Industries who oversees Project Monnoheor and presented its current status during the meeting.&lt;SEP&gt;A member of the Trehaett Applied Research Lab and the sender of the initial email regarding the Samopunel Beacon update and recognition of long-term service. They are responsible for providing project updates and coordinating with cross-functional teams.</data>
