      <data key="d0">Security Audits</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Routine checks conducted by Kiguror Veldala to ensure continued compliance with internal and external standards at the Zoluna Data Center.&lt;SEP&gt;Regular assessments planned by the Zugula Infrastructure Team to ensure the security of the Bozilron Ledger and Project Monnoheor systems.</data>
