    <node id="Legacy Systems">
      <data key="d0">Legacy Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">system</data>
      <data key="d2">Legacy Systems refer to older technological infrastructures that are currently in use across various projects and organizations, often presenting challenges in integration, scalability, and performance. These systems are found in multiple contexts, including the Zoluna Data Center, where they are being reviewed for potential upgrades due to compatibility issues with newer technologies. Similarly, Zastama Industries is dealing with outdated systems that may hinder the scalability of Project Ruzonine and are being integrated with new telemetry protocols as part of the Dambune Panarnoel initiative.

In the context of Project Vatuen, legacy systems are a source of integration challenges, while Project Krabehien is experiencing minor compatibility issues with the Temgumel Prism integration. The Femfasel Vault is also integrated with older systems that are currently under review to ensure continued optimal performance. Additionally, legacy systems are involved in the data migration process for the Vesterge Ledger and may pose compatibility risks for the Maslarine Compass, as noted in the risk register. Overall, these systems are a common concern across multiple initiatives, requiring careful evaluation and strategic planning to ensure smooth operations and future scalability.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-016-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-073-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-044-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-015-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-053-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-007-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-042-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-053-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-016&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-073&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-044&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-015&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-053&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-007&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-042&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-053</data>
