    <node id="Infrastructure Management">
      <data key="d0">Infrastructure Management</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A field of expertise in which Broteor Pikrisen has over a decade of experience. It involves the planning, implementation, and maintenance of the systems and networks that support an organization's operations.&lt;SEP&gt;A process overseen by Bitelor Brorisa to ensure the secure and continuous operation of systems relevant to Project Komsonor.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-013-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-017-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-013&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-017</data>
