    <node id="Cross-Departmental Coordination">
      <data key="d0">Cross-Departmental Coordination</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A collaborative approach used in Project Tinpia to ensure alignment across departments such as engineering, operations, and finance. It involves regular meetings chaired by Broteor Pikrisen to discuss technical requirements, dependencies, and potential bottlenecks.&lt;SEP&gt;A collaborative approach at Zastama Industries to ensure consistent communication and alignment of objectives across multiple teams and initiatives.&lt;SEP&gt;A collaborative effort between departments to ensure the success of Project Dremtona.&lt;SEP&gt;The ongoing review of collaboration between departments, particularly highlighted in the finance lead's recognition of Vosaett Neldelis's efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;A strategy to strengthen alignment between departments to ensure the project aligns with business objectives.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-013-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-029-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-054-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-037-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-043-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-021-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-013&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-054&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-037&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-043&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-021</data>
      <data key="d5">1793693604</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Testing">
      <data key="d0">Testing</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A phase of Project Tinpia that will occur as the project moves into its final stages. It involves evaluating the system to ensure it meets the required standards for performance and reliability.&lt;SEP&gt;A process used to evaluate the performance and reliability of a system or component. The Lozenor Lattice has required more extensive testing than initially anticipated.&lt;SEP&gt;A process at Zastama Industries to evaluate the effectiveness of new tools, such as incident response tools, before full deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;Testing involves validating the compatibility and reliability of the access control software stack with the vendor.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of evaluating the Maslarine Compass to ensure it meets technical and operational requirements, conducted by the Thanfuan Applied Research Lab.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-013-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-084-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-093-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-012-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-053-chunk-000</data>
