    <node id="Q1 FY26">
      <data key="d0">Q1 FY26</data>
      <data key="d1">timeframe</data>
      <data key="d2">The projected completion date for Project Tinpia. It refers to the first quarter of the fiscal year 2026.&lt;SEP&gt;The fiscal quarter in which the Donnoett Loom is scheduled to launch.&lt;SEP&gt;The scheduled launch quarter for the Donnoett Loom project.&lt;SEP&gt;The first quarter of the fiscal year 2026, referenced as the target launch period for the Donnoett Loom project.&lt;SEP&gt;Q1 FY26 refers to the first quarter of the fiscal year 2026, which is the completion target for Project Domesis. It is a key deadline for finalizing user interface adjustments and vendor deliverables.&lt;SEP&gt;The first quarter of fiscal year 2026, during which the Samopunel Beacon is scheduled for launch.&lt;SEP&gt;The fiscal quarter in which Project Krindais is scheduled to be completed.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-013-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-020-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-026-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-039-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-046-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-027-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-047-chunk-000</data>
