      <data key="d5">1793757823</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Implementation Phase">
      <data key="d0">Implementation Phase</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The current stage of Project Tinpia, during which key deliverables are expected in the upcoming quarters.&lt;SEP&gt;The upcoming phase of Project Sankonen, where the team will focus on building a scalable and secure foundation for the platform.&lt;SEP&gt;The current stage of Project Krabehien, where the team is working on executing the project plan and addressing technical and coordination challenges.&lt;SEP&gt;The Implementation Phase is the stage in a project where planned activities are executed, such as the upcoming phase for Project Kososett after planning is finalized.&lt;SEP&gt;Implementation Phase is the current stage of Project Zasmemine, where the project is being executed according to the approved plan and budget.&lt;SEP&gt;The current stage of Project Minkegais, where the enterprise automation solution is being developed and deployed.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-013-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-109-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-013-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-005-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-039-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-099-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-013&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-109&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-013&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-005&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-039&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-099</data>
      <data key="d5">1793759768</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
