      <data key="d0">Long-Term Employee</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A classification for employees at Zastama Industries who have been with the company for many years. Their experience and expertise are valued and contribute significantly to initiatives like Project Tinpia.</data>
