    <node id="System Architecture">
      <data key="d0">System Architecture</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A technical framework that defines the structure and behavior of systems. Zondila Krerraris has provided valuable insights into system architecture for Project Tinpia.&lt;SEP&gt;One of the two primary focus areas of Project Ralamel, involving the design and structure of the platform.&lt;SEP&gt;The design of the system for Project Tukrama, for which design reviews have been completed.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-013-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-024-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-001-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-013&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-024&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-001</data>
