      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">An initiative currently in the early design phase, being closely monitored by senior leadership for its potential impact on long-term strategic goals.&lt;SEP&gt;A project with a target completion date of Q4 FY27, currently on track with no major delays anticipated. It depends on the Brenian Console for its development.&lt;SEP&gt;A technical project at Zastama Industries built on the Brenian Console, currently on track to meet its next milestone in early Q4.</data>
