      <data key="d0">Fozuen Runpaor</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">An individual based at the Vurlekri Annex who oversees a variety of strategic initiatives at the site.&lt;SEP&gt;A long-standing team member who joined Zastama Industries in 2017 and has consistently provided valuable insights and maintained the integrity of internal processes.&lt;SEP&gt;The lead of Project Drugilett, working to address challenges and develop mitigation strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;Fozuen Runpaor is an individual acknowledged for their thoughtful responses and continued leadership, and is responsible for communications regarding next steps for Project Drugilett.&lt;SEP&gt;An employee of Zastama Industries since 2017, based at the Vurlekri Annex, known for leadership and attention to detail in managing day-to-day operations.</data>
