    <node id="Remfom Minfufoa">
      <data key="d0">Remfom Minfufoa</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A Product Manager responsible for aligning product development with market needs and company objectives, managing product lifecycle stages, and integrating customer feedback.&lt;SEP&gt;A Product Manager at Zastama Industries who guides new product development and emphasizes coordination with the incident response team to integrate user feedback and improve system resilience.&lt;SEP&gt;A leader at Zastama Industries who has been with the company since 2021 and is currently overseeing the progress of Project Vumzosa.&lt;SEP&gt;A person who is coordinating cross-project logistics and communicating updates to project leads.&lt;SEP&gt;Product Manager who provided an update on Project Serinen and outlined action items related to cross-departmental collaboration and resource planning.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-017-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-045-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-067-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-091-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-103-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-017&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-045&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-067&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-091&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-103</data>
      <data key="d5">1793665828</data>
