    <node id="Project Daslalett">
      <data key="d0">Project Daslalett</data>
      <data key="d1">project</data>
      <data key="d2">An active project owned and managed by the Kratavaen Infrastructure Team, aligned with broader infrastructure goals for Zastama Industries. It involves collaboration with Hurpuman Partners under a formal services contract.&lt;SEP&gt;Project Daslalett is a project operating under a services contract with Hurpuman Partners. It has encountered delays due to complexity in integrating legacy systems.&lt;SEP&gt;A future project at Zastama Industries, set to be completed by Q1 FY27, which will build on insights and technologies from other initiatives.&lt;SEP&gt;Project Daslalett is an initiative that involves the integration of the Broltala Loom. While not directly tied to Project Statugoan, delays in this project could affect downstream onboarding processes.&lt;SEP&gt;A strategic initiative within Zastama Industries, currently on track for completion in Q1 FY27.</data>
