    <node id="Cross-Team Collaboration">
      <data key="d0">Cross-Team Collaboration</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A concept emphasizing the importance of collaboration between teams, particularly for interdependent initiatives within Zastama Industries.&lt;SEP&gt;A strategic approach at Zastama Industries to maintain strong inter-lab communication and support projects that span multiple teams. It is facilitated by the leadership chain from Toperel Brirdoan to Votirmi Tresbior.&lt;SEP&gt;A collaborative approach between the Drurlomis Integration Team and the Drugoan Platform Group to work on overlapping projects and objectives.&lt;SEP&gt;The coordination between different departments to address challenges related to system compatibility and operational downtime.&lt;SEP&gt;Cross-Team Collaboration refers to the practice of working together across different departments to drive innovation and efficiency.</data>
