    <node id="Bozilron Ledger">
      <data key="d0">Bozilron Ledger</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A digital ledger system with approximately 1,600 active users, requiring ongoing development and hosting support. It is the focus of strategic review and future development planning.&lt;SEP&gt;A critical system for tracking and managing data across multiple internal systems, planned for integration with Project Monnoheor.&lt;SEP&gt;A system or component receiving critical parts from Nerasan Labs, integral to Project Stahilett.&lt;SEP&gt;A stable system with 1,600 active users, for which the Sabrinett Analytics Unit is developing a new reporting feature.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-018-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-119-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-037-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-070-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-018&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-119&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-037&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-070</data>
      <data key="d5">1793757981</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Dreto Zampusrar">
      <data key="d0">Dreto Zampusrar</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Dreto Zampusrar is a professional based at the Thamhuor Campus and has been associated with Zastama Industries since 2012. In this role, he has demonstrated a long-term commitment to the company, particularly to the Bozilron Ledger. As a Solutions Architect, Dreto has provided a systems-level view of the Femfasel Vault's integration with internal tools and external dependencies, showcasing his technical expertise. He coordinates with engineering teams to improve local infrastructure and supports the expansion of key projects at the campus, with a focus on enhancing the working environment for researchers and staff.

Dreto Zampusrar is also a project leader currently overseeing Project Stahilett, which is in the early stages of development and aims to enhance process efficiency and automation. His leadership in this initiative aligns with the company’s strategic direction, and he facilitates the exchange of ideas between departments to ensure development processes remain cohesive and goal-oriented. Additionally, he has acknowledged the work on Project Statugoan and offered to contribute insights during the review session, reflecting his involvement in multiple ongoing initiatives.

Beyond his project management responsibilities, Dreto leads a retrospective session for the Zugula Infrastructure Team and has experience with onboarding approaches, further emphasizing his role in fostering collaboration and continuous improvement within Zastama Industries.&lt;SEP&gt;A long-time employee who joined the company in 2012 and shared historical insights on past infrastructure projects.&lt;SEP&gt;A Solutions Architect at Zastama Industries who is central to the Q2 Technical Integration Project, responsible for integration framework development, procurement, and access protocols.&lt;SEP&gt;A Solutions Architect who participated in the meeting and discussed the technical implications of access control changes.&lt;SEP&gt;An employee of Zastama Industries who joined in 2012 and has contributed significantly to shaping user experiences across product lines. They were recently recognized for their 13 years of service.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-018-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-044-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-045-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-050-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-052-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-062-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-064-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-007-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-021-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-009-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-004-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-082-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-018&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-044&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-045&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-050&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-052&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-062&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-064&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-007&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-021&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-009&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-004&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-082</data>
      <data key="d5">1793758072</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Zugula Infrastructure Team">
      <data key="d0">Zugula Infrastructure Team</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Zugula Infrastructure Team is a department within Zastama Industries responsible for managing infrastructure-related initiatives, supporting internal operations, and driving strategic infrastructure projects. Based at the Thamhuor Campus, the team is led by Gudrosa Ganema and consists of 38 members. Their responsibilities span a wide range of infrastructure systems and projects, including the maintenance and optimization of the Samopunel Beacon, the Natrala Relay, the Lardoel Campus, the Bozilron Ledger, and the Tusgagiel Ledger. They are currently focused on environmental testing and performance evaluation of the Natrala Relay under simulated stress conditions.

The team plays a central role in identity and access management, overseeing authentication processes and secure user provisioning. They are also involved in enhancing the access control framework and supporting infrastructure adjustments for vendor-related initiatives. In addition, the Zugula Infrastructure Team is responsible for executing key initiatives such as Project Velbirum, Project Minkegais, and Project Golgoett, as well as modernizing core backend systems. Tamzoa Nargoett is a key member involved in evaluating new hardware configurations for these efforts. The team also supports the integration of the Bozilron Ledger with Project Monnoheor, including improvements to audit trails and access controls.&lt;SEP&gt;The Zugula Infrastructure Team is a group within Zastama Industries responsible for infrastructure development and integration. They have been instrumental in integrating new tooling and security enhancements for Project Lovulett.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-018-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-023-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-029-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-066-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-080-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-084-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-100-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-101-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-108-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-112-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-119-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-083-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-018&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-023&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-029&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-066&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-080&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-084&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-100&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-101&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-108&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-112&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-119&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-083</data>
      <data key="d5">1793695719</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
