      <data key="d0">Tusgagiel Ledger</data>
      <data key="d1">technology</data>
      <data key="d2">A system with approximately 7,700 active users that is experiencing growth in user engagement and requires performance improvements and user experience enhancements.&lt;SEP&gt;A system hosted at the Lardoel Campus that supports approximately 7,700 active users and is used for daily operations and data integrity.&lt;SEP&gt;A secure and scalable data layer developed by the Trehaett Applied Research Lab, serving as a critical component in Zastama Industries' technology stack.&lt;SEP&gt;The Tusgagiel Ledger is a core financial and operational tracking system hosted at the Lardoel Campus. It requires high availability and security and is integrated with identity systems managed by Gudrosa Ganema and the Drurlomis Integration Team.&lt;SEP&gt;A foundational technology used by Project Krindais to enable secure and scalable data processing.</data>
