      <data key="d2">A system hosted at the Pozoine Campus that operates at peak performance and is being optimized for infrastructure and security.&lt;SEP&gt;An enterprise-tier solution offered by Zastama Industries that has seen significant interest and adoption, with about 3,300 active users.&lt;SEP&gt;A system or database developed by the Gekreine Applied Research Lab that is a focus of cross-team collaboration.&lt;SEP&gt;Vesterge Ledger is a major enterprise initiative scheduled for launch in Q4 FY28. It is undergoing a comprehensive audit process to ensure regulatory compliance and has been identified as requiring process enhancements and documentation improvements.&lt;SEP&gt;A development initiative on track for a Q4 FY28 launch, currently in the beta phase with user acceptance testing scheduled to begin next month.&lt;SEP&gt;A digital ledger system currently in a stabilization phase, undergoing development and compliance monitoring. It has a modular architecture and is being reviewed for long-term scalability.</data>
