    <node id="Genfinel Platform Group">
      <data key="d0">Genfinel Platform Group</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A group within Zastama Industries responsible for managing Project Ralamel and coordinating its development and integration with other initiatives.&lt;SEP&gt;A group responsible for the strategic and technical direction of Project Porkuine.&lt;SEP&gt;Genfinel Platform Group is an organization responsible for managing and optimizing customer onboarding flows and collaborating with Drestoa Hasgaor on demand forecasting model integration.&lt;SEP&gt;A group within Zastama Industries focused on developing scalable infrastructure to support the company's growing product and service offerings.&lt;SEP&gt;A central development team at Zastama Industries responsible for the Brenian Console and the Hunbenan Beacon.&lt;SEP&gt;A group within Zastama Industries with 7 members and an annual budget of $1.0M, focused on platform development and strategic goals.&lt;SEP&gt;Genfinel Platform Group is responsible for ensuring that vendor agreements align with broader platform strategy and compliance standards. It is involved in reviewing and assessing the Hurpuman Partners master services agreement and evaluating the long-term viability of the partnership.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-024-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-106-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-059-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-097-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-089-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-098-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-036-chunk-000</data>
