    </node>
    <node id="Tamzoa Nargoett">
      <data key="d0">Tamzoa Nargoett</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The leader of Project Ralamel, overseeing the development and execution of its objectives and coordinating the work of the five-person team.&lt;SEP&gt;A leader who oversees Project Ralamel, a pivotal initiative requiring coordination and strategic planning.&lt;SEP&gt;Tamzoa Nargoett is a person coordinating the integration of data retention tools and managing the deployment of systems for Project Ralamel.&lt;SEP&gt;An active member of the Zugula Infrastructure Team, contributing to the day-to-day execution of Project Velbirum.&lt;SEP&gt;A key member of the Zugula Infrastructure Team, involved in evaluating new hardware configurations to improve system resilience.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-024-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-060-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-079-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-100-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-112-chunk-000</data>
