      <data key="d5">1793695230</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Brenian Console">
      <data key="d0">Brenian Console</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A platform used by Project Hamuis, expected to provide foundational capabilities for integration with Project Ralamel’s systems.&lt;SEP&gt;A system used by approximately 3,100 active users at Zastama Industries for day-to-day tasks, with ongoing monitoring of its performance and user feedback.&lt;SEP&gt;A console known for its reliability and scalability, serving as the foundation for Project Drosvais.&lt;SEP&gt;A critical infrastructure component used by both Project Dramen and Project Drosvais. Its Q3 FY27 launch date is a key milestone for multiple teams.&lt;SEP&gt;A technical platform or system used as the foundation for Project Dramen and Project Hamuis at Zastama Industries.&lt;SEP&gt;A robust system with approximately 3,100 active users, serving as a foundational tool in Zastama Industries' technology portfolio.</data>
