    <node id="April 15, 2025">
      <data key="d0">April 15, 2025</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">April 15, 2025, is a significant date marked by multiple deadlines across various departments and individuals. It is the deadline for the Trehaett Applied Research Lab to submit a revised budget plan for Project Monnoheor. Additionally, Munnam Furzil is required to send a procurement summary to the finance representative and procurement lead by this date.

Vadesis Gummenbel must confirm with the escrow service provider that the system associated with reference DJ-7108-L remains in active status and provide written confirmation to Pobraor Tosaett. The Finance Representative has two key tasks due on this date: compiling a report on documentation gaps related to the Lorhia Loom and preparing a financial impact analysis.

The Legal Advisor is also required to confirm the compliance of the Brapoett Vault's terms by April 15, 2025. The IT Access Manager must create a task list for the pilot program, and Dastona Tiheor is responsible for preparing and submitting the onboarding observations summary. Finally, Foltala Dankenor must submit an updated plan by this date.&lt;SEP&gt;The deadline for Lithen Brisisel to distribute a detailed report on the integration progress of Project Tinpia.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-119-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-040-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-039-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-031-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-045-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-054-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-005-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-029-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-037-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-021-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-119&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-040&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-039&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-031&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-045&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-054&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-005&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-029&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-037&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-021</data>
      <data key="d5">1793693604</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="April 18, 2025">
      <data key="d0">April 18, 2025</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The date of the next meeting to review cross-functional alignment and address any further concerns.&lt;SEP&gt;The deadline for Selnaor Padroa to submit the external audit report findings and supporting documentation.&lt;SEP&gt;April 18, 2025, is the deadline for the finance representative to confirm no new budget line items are required for the corrective actions.&lt;SEP&gt;The date of the follow-up meeting where the review committee will present preliminary findings and propose a path forward for Project Sankonen.&lt;SEP&gt;The date for the first review session of the working group focused on the Brapoett Vault.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_a-039-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-054-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-027-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-029-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-021-chunk-000</data>
