    <node id="Phased Rollout">
      <data key="d0">Phased Rollout</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A deployment strategy for the Donnoett Loom's upgraded hardware to ensure minimal disruption to its 4,700 active users.&lt;SEP&gt;A potential next stage for Project Tremenine, involving gradual expansion across additional departments.&lt;SEP&gt;A strategy used by the Sabrinett Analytics Unit to implement revised data protocols in stages to ensure system stability and user readiness.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_b-038-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-040-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-043-chunk-000</data>
