    </node>
    <node id="Project Timeline">
      <data key="d0">Project Timeline</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A schedule outlining the planned execution of project activities, which is monitored and adhered to by all teams at Zastama Industries.&lt;SEP&gt;Project Timeline refers to the schedule for the upcoming field operation at the Krafuline Field Office, which is dependent on the timely receipt of the items in the procurement order.&lt;SEP&gt;The Project Timeline refers to the schedule and planning for the Vesterge Ledger initiative, including the audit process and the planned launch in Q4 FY28. It is being reviewed to ensure all compliance-related gaps are addressed before deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;Project Timeline refers to the schedule of activities and milestones for the Gahikron Campus infrastructure improvements, which is being maintained by Bitelor Brorisa.&lt;SEP&gt;The schedule for Project Pomtorgi, which has been revised and is being considered in relation to the Brepemrir Logistics contract.&lt;SEP&gt;The schedule of key milestones and deadlines for a project, such as Project Vatuen, which is monitored to ensure timely completion.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-031-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-006-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-049-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-052-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-049-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-099-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-031&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-006&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-049&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-052&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-049&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-099</data>
      <data key="d5">1793759768</data>
