      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A document summarizing the discussions, decisions, and action items from the meeting on office space and team realignment at Zastama Industries.&lt;SEP&gt;The meeting notes are a summary of the discussion and action items from the Regional Operations Review meeting, to be circulated by the compliance officer.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-061-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-027-chunk-000</data>
