      <data key="d0">Q2 Strategic Review and Resource Allocation Meeting</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">A meeting held on June 6, 2025, to assess the status of active projects, discuss cross-functional challenges, and align on resource planning across departments.</data>
