    <node id="Project Laboel">
      <data key="d0">Project Laboel</data>
      <data key="d1">project</data>
      <data key="d2">An active project being developed on the Sestan Loom platform, staffed by 32 people and with an approved budget of $3.1M. It is on track for its current deliverables and faces challenges in integration with external vendors.&lt;SEP&gt;A cross-functional initiative supported by a team of 32 individuals, including engineers, product managers, and external partners. It is progressing as planned and involves weekly internal briefings and shared progress documentation.&lt;SEP&gt;A project led by Garhoel Thaterona, focusing on refining the user interface and experience for a new internal tool.&lt;SEP&gt;A project in the early development phase, built on the Sestan Loom and requiring coordination with the Vurlekri Annex team.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-025-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-031-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-112-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-037-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-025&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-031&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-112&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-037</data>
      <data key="d5">1793757682</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Project Drugilett">
      <data key="d0">Project Drugilett</data>
      <data key="d1">project</data>
      <data key="d2">An active project being developed on the Sestan Loom platform. It shares infrastructure with Project Laboel and requires close coordination to ensure compatibility and minimize conflicts.&lt;SEP&gt;An ongoing initiative in emerging technologies, owned and managed by the Fozola Applied Research Lab.&lt;SEP&gt;Project Drugilett is a project that will be reviewed in detail at the executive level, with a revised plan in development and expected to impact downstream efforts, including those related to Project Minkegais.&lt;SEP&gt;A project at Zastama Industries that is currently at risk due to integration challenges and delays in vendor documentation.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-025-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-041-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-115-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-115-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-025&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-041&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-115</data>
      <data key="d5">1793666919</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Sestan Loom">
      <data key="d0">Sestan Loom</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A platform on which both Project Laboel and Project Drugilett are being developed. It is central to the integration and coordination of the two projects.&lt;SEP&gt;A system or project that relies on components supplied by Dapoan Consulting and Halrurine Logistics.&lt;SEP&gt;A technical foundation or system upon which Project Statugoan is built, as discussed during the Strategic Planning and Operational Review Meeting.&lt;SEP&gt;A foundational platform at Zastam Industries that enables scalable integration and real-time data processing. It serves as the technical backbone for Project Statugoan.&lt;SEP&gt;A system or platform on which Project Laboel is built.&lt;SEP&gt;A platform developed by the Fozola Applied Research Lab with approximately 2,000 active users, currently undergoing updates based on user feedback.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-025-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-101-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-105-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-057-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-037-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-034-chunk-000</data>
