      <data key="d2">A research organization that developed the Sallama Lattice and is collaborating with Zastama Industries on Project Thibelan.&lt;SEP&gt;A pivotal research initiative within Zastama Industries, responsible for developing foundational technologies that support ongoing and future projects.&lt;SEP&gt;Research facility at the Thamhuor Campus that requested infrastructure support and access rights for collaborative projects.&lt;SEP&gt;A parallel unit within the research division of Zastama Industries, responsible for the development of the Samopunel Beacon.&lt;SEP&gt;Responsible for ensuring expenditures of Project Monnoheor remain within budget limits and for implementing identity and access tooling aligned with Zastama Industries' security protocols.&lt;SEP&gt;A research division within Zastama Industries where Fonathe Drirum is a key member and where innovation in warehouse automation is being driven.&lt;SEP&gt;A research laboratory within Zastama Industries responsible for the development of the Samopunel Beacon. It consists of 16 dedicated members and works closely with cross-functional teams.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-040-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-053-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-062-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-069-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-119-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-026-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-082-chunk-000</data>
