    </node>
    <node id="Demse Dofama">
      <data key="d0">Demse Dofama</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A Site Reliability Lead at Zastama Industries who oversees the stability and performance of internal systems and has implemented new monitoring tools to improve system uptime and response times.&lt;SEP&gt;An integral member of the engineering team at Zastama Industries who reports to Rimoett Dozeine.&lt;SEP&gt;A person who is the lead at the Lelosis Field Office and the primary liaison with Trorvelor Partners.&lt;SEP&gt;A representative from the Lelosis Field Office who supports the work on Project Sankonen and collaborates with Fonathe Drirum on financial planning and cross-departmental coordination.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-049-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-065-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-091-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-026-chunk-000</data>
