    <node id="Soramis Nolaor">
      <data key="d0">Soramis Nolaor</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Soramis Nolaor is a person who is collaborating with Debrol Babroine to monitor the Broltala Loom integration with Project Daslalett. They are also invited to the cross-departmental review session for Project Statugoan.&lt;SEP&gt;Soramis Nolaor is a senior leader in the company who communicates updates on planning and reporting structures, vendor renewals, and coordinates with various teams on cross-functional projects.&lt;SEP&gt;Finance Lead who provided a budget review for Project Serinen and outlined action items related to financial forecasting and committee follow-ups.&lt;SEP&gt;Finance Lead at Zastama Industries since 2024, responsible for bringing strategic insight to financial planning and project execution.&lt;SEP&gt;The Finance Lead at Zastama Industries, responsible for budget management, financial forecasting, and ensuring alignment with business objectives.</data>
