      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A Compliance Officer who is reviewing the Stivois Partners procurement and access management for compliance purposes.&lt;SEP&gt;Compliance Officer overseeing procurement and regulatory alignment for Project Krabehien.&lt;SEP&gt;Maneor Tismean is the head of the Bomekraen Infrastructure Team and holds contract number EP-8854-N. They are responsible for overseeing the team's budget and ensuring alignment with strategic goals, particularly for Project Dremtona.&lt;SEP&gt;Maneor Tismean is the Compliance Officer at Zastama Industries, responsible for ensuring that all contractual terms with Zitrien Partners are reviewed and maintained. They are also reviewing the broader compliance framework and risk mitigation strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual who supports Soramis Nolaor by focusing on demand forecasting models and developing analytical tools to inform strategic and operational decisions.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_a-010-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-036-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-015-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-028-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-027-chunk-000</data>
