    <node id="Project Mennamett">
      <data key="d0">Project Mennamett</data>
      <data key="d1">project</data>
      <data key="d2">A project led by Nesoror Dramkolor, with the objective of delivering a transformative solution aligned with Zastama Industries' strategic goals. It has an approved budget of $9.3M and is subject to regular reviews with senior leadership.&lt;SEP&gt;Project Mennamett is a key project that remains on target for completion in Q1 FY28. The focus areas include optimizing system performance and ensuring compliance requirements are met.&lt;SEP&gt;A project led by Nesoror Dramkolor, currently on schedule for the final phase of implementation expected to begin in May 2026, with key risks including supply chain delays and resource allocation issues.&lt;SEP&gt;A critical initiative at Zastama Industries that supports the company's product roadmap and long-term innovation strategy.</data>
