    <node id="Product Roadmap">
      <data key="d0">Product Roadmap</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A strategic plan for product development at Zastama Industries, maintained by the senior executive director of product development. It aligns cross-team efforts to support growth objectives.&lt;SEP&gt;The strategic plan outlining the development and launch of the Lorhia Loom, which has been confirmed to align with the projected timeline.&lt;SEP&gt;A strategic plan outlining the development and feature integration for the access tooling in Project Golgoett. It is managed by Nammian Bahoine at Zastama Industries.&lt;SEP&gt;A strategic plan at Zastama Industries that outlines the development and launch of new products, including Project Mennamett.&lt;SEP&gt;A strategic plan followed by Zastama Industries to guide the development and evolution of the Samopunel Beacon, ensuring it meets customer expectations and business goals.</data>
