      <data key="d0">Infrastructure Upgrades</data>
      <data key="d1">project</data>
      <data key="d2">Infrastructure Upgrades are improvements to the company's technical infrastructure, including capacity planning and system reliability.&lt;SEP&gt;A set of improvements being conducted by Fakra Sermus's team to support the broader goals of Project Sankonen and other initiatives.&lt;SEP&gt;Ongoing efforts to expand and improve internal systems at Zastama Industries.&lt;SEP&gt;Potential improvements to the Tanumett Relay and other systems to enhance performance and reliability.&lt;SEP&gt;Proposed improvements to the Krafuline Field Office, including electrical systems and HVAC, to support increased occupancy.</data>
