      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Technical Debt refers to the accumulated inefficiencies and outdated systems that require attention to maintain system reliability and support future growth.&lt;SEP&gt;A measure of accumulated development inefficiencies, which has not been identified as a significant issue for the Vesterge Ledger at this time.</data>
