      <data key="d2">Strategic Planning Meeting is the event where participants reviewed current initiatives, discussed future goals, and outlined action items for the upcoming fiscal quarter.&lt;SEP&gt;A meeting held on April 10, 2025, to discuss strategic priorities and operational reviews at Zastama Industries.</data>
