    <node id="Project Office">
      <data key="d0">Project Office</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A centralized team or department responsible for managing and coordinating multiple projects, ensuring alignment with corporate objectives and efficient resource distribution.&lt;SEP&gt;The Project Office is a central point of contact for employees with questions or concerns about Hurpuman Partners or related activities. It is responsible for providing guidance and posting updates on the status of the master services agreement.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-031-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-036-chunk-000</data>
