    <node id="Accountability">
      <data key="d0">Accountability</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The responsibility of individuals or teams to be answerable for their actions and decisions, which is encouraged by Balpoen Drinvamor across the organization.&lt;SEP&gt;Accountability is a principle emphasized in the financial management of the Kusbosine Console, ensuring that spending is aligned with strategic goals and responsibilities are clear.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-031-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-059-chunk-000</data>
