    <node id="Project Documentation">
      <data key="d0">Project Documentation</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The written records and reports generated during a project, such as the documentation of risk assessments and progress updates.&lt;SEP&gt;Project Documentation refers to the records and reports being updated to ensure all information related to Project Medeis is current and accurate.&lt;SEP&gt;The records and reports related to the Maslarine Compass project, which are reviewed and approved by Pelron Loshoan to ensure compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;The written records and materials that describe a project's scope, plan, progress, and outcomes, such as those used in Project Vatuen and Project Minkegais.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-031-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-034-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-053-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-099-chunk-000</data>
