      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A group of individuals working together to achieve the objectives of a project, such as the 32-person team supporting Project Laboel.&lt;SEP&gt;The Project Team consists of cross-departmental stakeholders who collaborate with Pedusel Ruloett to align technical, operational, and policy requirements for Project Dernelnar.&lt;SEP&gt;The team responsible for the Mumteror Prism project, currently in the final stages of integration testing and coordinating with internal departments.&lt;SEP&gt;The team responsible for the execution and coordination of Project Thedraman activities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Project Team is involved in Project Gadramor and is in regular communication with Hurpuman Partners to ensure timely and compliant equipment delivery. They are also assessing the impact of the upcoming renewal process.&lt;SEP&gt;The group of individuals responsible for the execution of a project, such as the interdisciplinary team managing Project Minkegais.</data>
