      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Q3 Strategic Review and Operational Planning Meeting is a company-wide meeting held to ensure alignment across key operational sites and projects. It took place on May 2, 2025.&lt;SEP&gt;A meeting held on April 3, 2025, to review strategic and operational planning for ongoing projects and company-wide initiatives.</data>
