      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The Standardized Reporting Template is a proposed format for all operational reports at Zastama Industries. It aims to resolve a 15% variance in reporting formats between the Vurlekri Annex and the Pozoine Campus.</data>
