      <data key="d0">Logistics Partner</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Logistics Partner is the current supplier for raw material delivery at the Vurlekri Annex. The team is investigating alternative suppliers to reduce dependency on this partner.</data>
