      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Alternative Suppliers are being considered by the Vurlekri Annex team to reduce dependency on the current logistics partner and improve supply chain coordination.&lt;SEP&gt;A strategy being explored by Zastama Industries to reduce reliance on Brimumor Labs and mitigate potential supply chain risks.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-033-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-093-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-033&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-093</data>
      <data key="d5">1793692647</data>
