    <node id="Next Company-Wide Meeting">
      <data key="d0">Next Company-Wide Meeting</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Next Company-Wide Meeting is scheduled for July 2025. It is intended to continue the alignment and coordination efforts across Zastama Industries.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-033-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-033</data>
      <data key="d5">1793657074</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Project Monnoheor">
      <data key="d0">Project Monnoheor</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A project built on the Ketemram Vault, currently in the testing phase after completing foundational architecture.&lt;SEP&gt;An ongoing initiative at Zastama Industries, led by Holol Kareman, currently in a phase with logistical challenges but on schedule.&lt;SEP&gt;A project under review for its budget and implementation of identity and access tools. It has an approved budget of $3.5M and is managed with a focus on transparency and accountability.&lt;SEP&gt;A strategic project with an approved budget of $3.5M, currently progressing as planned and undergoing the integration of the Ketemram Vault to enhance its capabilities.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-050-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-107-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-119-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-034-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-050&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-107&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-119&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-034</data>
      <data key="d5">1793759058</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Ketemram Vault">
      <data key="d0">Ketemram Vault</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Ketemram Vault is a secure, enterprise-tier technological infrastructure and platform primarily associated with the development and enhancement of strategic projects. Hosted at the Lardoel Campus, it serves as a foundational system for Project Pomtorgi, on which the project is being built and enhanced with robust encryption and access control features. As a product offered by Zastama Industries, Ketemram Vault supports approximately 2,500 active users and is recognized for its stable performance and scalability. It is designed to enable advanced data processing and is used as a base for other initiatives, including Project Krindais, where it is being integrated to improve the system's security and reliability. Its role as a critical infrastructure component underscores its importance in supporting complex and mission-critical operations across multiple projects.&lt;SEP&gt;A system or component being integrated into both Project Monnoheor and Project Pomtorgi to enhance their capabilities.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-046-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-048-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-050-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-091-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-100-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-114-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-059-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-047-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-034-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-046&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-048&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-050&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-091&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-100&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-114&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-059&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-047&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-034</data>
      <data key="d5">1793759058</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Project Pomtorgi">
      <data key="d0">Project Pomtorgi</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Project Pomtorgi is a key initiative at Zastama Industries, primarily built on the Ketemram Vault, and represents a significant investment in the company's technological infrastructure. The project is focused on enhancing data security, addressing challenges related to data consistency and latency, and expanding enterprise capabilities. It is designed to open new avenues for business growth and is aligned with broader strategic goals. As of early 2024, the project was paused pending a review of its updated technical architecture due to design inconsistencies and a misalignment with strategic priorities.

Project Pomtorgi is currently staffed by 22 individuals and has entered a critical phase of integration with third-party systems. This phase involves restricted access to a vault key (TR-1424-Q) and requires a thorough review of the project's architecture to address performance concerns. The initiative also involves the development of components for the Zartesis Prism and is under evaluation by the engineering team. Additionally, the project requires budget allocation and procurement management, and is currently undergoing a budget review process. Despite the pause, the project is progressing steadily in other areas and is expected to resume once the architectural and strategic issues are resolved.&lt;SEP&gt;A project built on the Ketemram Vault, with a focus on aligning with broader strategic goals and expected to meet its next milestone soon.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-048-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-050-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-087-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-091-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-100-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-114-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-027-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-030-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-055-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-059-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-049-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-034-chunk-000</data>
