      <data key="d2">A communication system with about 900 active users, currently being evaluated for possible upgrades due to usage growth and maintenance concerns.&lt;SEP&gt;A product in the Zastama Industries product suite with approximately 900 active users. It is considered a foundational component for future feature expansion and is currently in the standard tier.&lt;SEP&gt;A major project scheduled for launch in Q3 FY27, representing a significant step forward for Zastama Industries.&lt;SEP&gt;A system or infrastructure component serving about 900 active users, experiencing performance bottlenecks during peak usage times.&lt;SEP&gt;A system or infrastructure component that forms the foundation of Project Drezen.</data>
