    <node id="Logistics Team">
      <data key="d0">Logistics Team</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Logistics Team is an internal team at Zastama Industries responsible for managing and optimizing various aspects of supply chain and delivery operations. The team works closely with external partners such as Krodaor Thaborine and Gibasan Logistics to enhance supply chain efficiency and manage delivery timelines, particularly for projects like Project Nondaran. In addition, the Logistics Team collaborates with the operations and engineering teams to ensure that project timelines are met and that operational efficiency is maintained, especially in initiatives such as Project Drezen.

One of the key responsibilities of the Logistics Team is to prepare the site for the receipt of equipment, particularly from Pengamine Consulting, and to coordinate with campus personnel to ensure that all deliveries are received and stored appropriately. The team also plays a critical role in finalizing delivery schedules and supporting procurement logistics. Furthermore, the Logistics Team is involved in follow-up reviews aimed at accelerating the escrow process, demonstrating its broader involvement in project coordination and execution.&lt;SEP&gt;A team at Zastama Industries involved in the implementation of new logistics solutions and coordination with other departments.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-071-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-047-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-008-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-018-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-022-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-036-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-030-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-035-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-004-chunk-000</data>
