      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A contractual agreement between Zastama Industries and Stevosdim Partners for the execution of Project Zelpan, defining the scope, deliverables, and responsibilities of both parties.&lt;SEP&gt;A formal agreement between Zastama Industries and Rothun Consulting outlining the roles and access rights for the latter.&lt;SEP&gt;The Services Contract is a document that governs the partnership between Zastama Industries and Gibasan Logistics for Project Domesis. It defines roles, performance metrics, and reporting responsibilities.&lt;SEP&gt;A contractual agreement between Zastama Industries and Mortalis Consulting for the provision of consulting services to Project Hemvon.&lt;SEP&gt;The Services Contract is a specific agreement between Hurpuman Partners and Project Gadramor. It outlines the technical specifications and deliverables required for the project.</data>
