    <node id="Project Lead">
      <data key="d0">Project Lead</data>
      <data key="d1">role</data>
      <data key="d2">Project Lead is a person at Zastama Industries who will be informed about the reconciliation process for transparency regarding the Zitrien Partners contract.&lt;SEP&gt;A person from the Donnoett Loom team who provided updates on the project's status, including recent testing phases and the need for additional resources during the final deployment phase.&lt;SEP&gt;The individual overseeing the execution of Project Lathonel and tracking its progress.&lt;SEP&gt;The Project Lead is the individual responsible for managing and overseeing the execution of a project, such as Project Golgoett or Project Kososett, ensuring alignment with goals, timelines, and budget constraints.&lt;SEP&gt;The individual overseeing the execution of Project Nondaran, coordinating with internal teams and external partners.&lt;SEP&gt;A key stakeholder in both Project Hinzosine and the Vesterge Ledger, responsible for overseeing project progress and stakeholder engagement.</data>
