    </node>
    <node id="Technical Specifications">
      <data key="d0">Technical Specifications</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A set of specifications being refined as part of Project Hamuis.&lt;SEP&gt;Defined standards that equipment delivered by Mepoen Consulting must meet for deployment at the Kralinan Data Center.&lt;SEP&gt;Detailed descriptions of the capabilities and requirements of the incident response tooling.&lt;SEP&gt;Technical Specifications are the detailed requirements that equipment delivered by Hurpuman Partners must meet. They are outlined in the services contract with Project Gadramor.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_a-007-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-019-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-046-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-036-chunk-000</data>
