      <data key="d0">Project Milestones</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Key points in the timeline of Project Sankonen that indicate progress and completion of phases.&lt;SEP&gt;Key achievements in the execution of Zastama Industries' projects, met through the coordination of teams and communication.&lt;SEP&gt;Key points in the development of the Samopunel Beacon that the Trehaett Applied Research Lab is working toward with the support of cross-functional teams.&lt;SEP&gt;Key points in a project's timeline, such as those in Project Vatuen, that indicate progress and completion of major tasks.</data>
