    <node id="Thokro Pobris">
      <data key="d0">Thokro Pobris</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Thokro Pobris is an employee of Zastama Industries who has worked on fleet telemetry since 2016. His work has improved real-time monitoring capabilities for logistics and asset tracking.&lt;SEP&gt;A finance representative and team lead at Zastama Industries, primarily focused on fleet telemetry development. They coordinate with the Krorhitra Console team to integrate telemetry data and improve real-time analytics for clients.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual in the engineering division of Zastama Industries who reports to Gonnom Gosmunza and has been engaged in initiatives requiring cross-team collaboration, particularly in supporting the development of Project Vatuen.&lt;SEP&gt;A team leader at Zastama Industries who is spearheading the development of enhanced fleet monitoring tools for telemetry and focuses on fleet telemetry.&lt;SEP&gt;A person assigned to prepare a technical assessment of the current access tooling against new requirements for Project Golgoett. They are coordinating with Nammian Bahoine and Nasomel Sonmerett.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-038-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-068-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-076-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-093-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-055-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-038&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-068&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-076&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-093&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-055</data>
      <data key="d5">1793694834</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Project Tholgu">
      <data key="d0">Project Tholgu</data>
      <data key="d1">project</data>
      <data key="d2">Project Tholgu is an initiative at Zastama Industries that is progressing under the leadership of Nasomel Sonmerett. It integrates telemetry data and data science insights to enhance scalability and adaptability to market demands.&lt;SEP&gt;A project that leverages services from Dapoan Consulting to meet its operational goals.&lt;SEP&gt;A project being monitored for its alignment with long-term research objectives, discussed during the Strategic Planning and Operational Review Meeting. It is under the stewardship of the Daslaor Applied Research Lab.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-038-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-101-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-105-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-038&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-101&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-105</data>
      <data key="d5">1793665929</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Fleet Telemetry">
      <data key="d0">Fleet Telemetry</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Fleet Telemetry refers to the data streams collected from a fleet of vehicles or systems, used for monitoring and optimizing operations. It is a technical focus area at Zastama Industries, primarily managed by Thokro Pobris since 2016, and involves collecting and integrating data to improve real-time analytics for clients, particularly in the enterprise segment. Fleet telemetry data is used for monitoring and predictive maintenance, and it is a central focus of Project Medeis and related research.

Fleet Telemetry is also a system or initiative focused on improving real-time data collection and analysis capabilities for fleet operations. Toperel Brirdoan is leading a focused effort in this area, and the system at Zastama Industries tracks and reports on fleet performance, recently upgraded to improve data accuracy and maintenance efficiency. It is a data-driven method used at the Pozoine Campus for monitoring and improving operational efficiency.

Additionally, Fleet Telemetry is a set of initiatives focused on enhancing data gathering and analysis capabilities for remote monitoring systems at Zastama Industries. It is also being developed as part of the Dambune Panarnoel initiative, aimed at improving real-time data accuracy and system responsiveness for fleet operations.&lt;SEP&gt;A system used by Zastama Industries to collect and analyze data from its fleet operations. It is critical for maintaining operational efficiency and optimizing performance metrics.&lt;SEP&gt;A method used at Zastama Industries to monitor, optimize, and maintain the performance of transportation and logistics systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-038-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-042-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-063-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-068-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-071-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-084-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-107-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-053-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-019-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-046-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-057-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-097-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-038&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-042&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-063&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-068&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-084&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-107&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-053&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-019&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-046&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-057&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-097</data>
      <data key="d5">1793695932</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
