      <data key="d0">Real-Time Monitoring</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Real-Time Monitoring is a method used in fleet telemetry to improve logistics and asset tracking. It is a key component of Zastama Industries' operational improvements.&lt;SEP&gt;A capability being enhanced by Project Sankonen to improve decision-making and operational efficiency.</data>
