    <node id="Project Drannen">
      <data key="d0">Project Drannen</data>
      <data key="d1">project</data>
      <data key="d2">A critical initiative in the active implementation phase, focused on system interoperability and process optimization. It is managed by the Drurlomis Integration Team with an approved budget of $7.7M.&lt;SEP&gt;A pivotal project in developing new infrastructure capabilities, currently paused pending a comprehensive review.&lt;SEP&gt;A data-heavy simulation and modeling project led by Lithen Brisisel that requires stable infrastructure support.&lt;SEP&gt;A project in the implementation phase, supported by Nerasan Labs under a services contract, with a focus on scalability and integration with existing systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-044-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-048-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-062-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-116-chunk-000</data>
