    <node id="Kelhupi Rabralor">
      <data key="d0">Kelhupi Rabralor</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A person who is sending an email to all employees regarding operational status and vendor engagement, emphasizing transparency and coordination between campuses.&lt;SEP&gt;The leader of Project Drosvais, who coordinates with internal stakeholders to ensure alignment with organizational goals.&lt;SEP&gt;A long-time employee of the company, involved in outlining the current process for accessing the Femfasel Vault and identifying areas for improvement in clarity and security.&lt;SEP&gt;A member of the Nomfotesa Risk Office who is actively involved in the oversight, coordination, and risk review of Project Thedraman.&lt;SEP&gt;A long-tenured employee of Zastama Industries since 2017, currently undergoing a re-evaluation of access privileges and cost center management.&lt;SEP&gt;A technical expert at Zastama Industries who works under Pikera Tasfeis. Kelhupi Rabralor supports development teams in processing and analyzing telemetry data to meet both immediate and long-term strategic goals.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-046-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-113-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-007-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-025-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-055-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-057-chunk-000</data>
