      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A person who is the lead for the Lardoel Campus and provides updates on the status of the Ketemram Vault and Krorhitra Console, as well as coordination with Trorvelor Partners.&lt;SEP&gt;A leader based at the Lardoel Campus of Zastama Industries, responsible for overseeing regional operations and ensuring the smooth functioning of day-to-day activities.&lt;SEP&gt;A key member of the Drurlomis Integration Team who leads efforts to streamline integration protocols for Project Hamuis.&lt;SEP&gt;A cross-functional expert on the Drurlomis Integration Team, contributing to the coordination of integration milestones.&lt;SEP&gt;A member of the Drurlomis Integration Team, involved in Project Vatuen and responsible for coordinating integration challenges and cross-departmental collaboration.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-046-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-054-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-074-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-075-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-073-chunk-000</data>
