      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A critical infrastructure component hosted at the Lardoel Campus.&lt;SEP&gt;A key revenue-generating product for Zastama Industries with approximately 6,900 active users. It is a focus for feature enhancements and performance optimization, and it is central to real-time analytics and telemetry integration.&lt;SEP&gt;A product developed by the Thellusen Applied Research Lab, offered in the standard tier to streamline complex data processes and improve user efficiency.</data>
