    <node id="Trorvelor Partners">
      <data key="d0">Trorvelor Partners</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A vendor partner that collaborates with the Lardoel Campus for the continued functionality of the Ketemram Vault.&lt;SEP&gt;An external partner providing specialized expertise and resources to Zastama Industries for the implementation of Project Drezen.&lt;SEP&gt;Trorvelor Partners is a provider of specialized integration and deployment services. Zastama Industries has an ongoing 12-month master services agreement with them to support integration initiatives, including those related to identity and access systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Trorvelor Partners is a partner organization involved in integration efforts related to Project Velbirum.&lt;SEP&gt;A partner organization responsible for equipment delivery under a 12-month master services agreement.</data>
