    <node id="April 17, 2025">
      <data key="d0">April 17, 2025</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">April 17, 2025 is a significant date marked by multiple professional and project-related activities. It is the deadline for Dreto Zampusrar to submit a detailed progress report for Project Stahilett. Additionally, Kavemen Hilister is scheduled to present an updated financial status report to the finance team and project steering committee on this date.

April 17, 2025 also serves as the date for several key meetings. A follow-up meeting will be held to review new cost data for the Riguen Annex. A cross-functional review meeting is planned to align the marketing, operations, and support teams in preparation for the public announcement of the Donnoett Loom launch. Furthermore, the next budget review meeting will take place to reassess the procurement order and overall project financial status.

Losmais Zoslesine is required to provide a detailed status report on Project Medeis during the next Strategy and Project Update Meeting, which is also scheduled for this date. Additionally, April 17, 2025 is the date of the next scheduled meeting regarding the Femfasel Vault. Finally, Sosbuel Nervoen must complete and submit the legal assessment report by this deadline.&lt;SEP&gt;April 17, 2025, is the date of the follow-up meeting to review revised forecasts and assess budget alignment.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-050-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-004-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-039-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-059-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-027-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-045-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-007-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-029-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-037-chunk-000</data>
