    <node id="Project Kanponan">
      <data key="d0">Project Kanponan</data>
      <data key="d1">project</data>
      <data key="d2">A project currently in the pilot phase, focused on testing core operational workflows, refining user feedback loops, and aligning with strategic goals. It involves close collaboration with internal stakeholders and is supported by the UX Researcher Drestoa Hasgaor.&lt;SEP&gt;A project currently in the pilot phase, discussed during the Strategic Planning and Operational Review Meeting. The focus is on refining the user experience and validating scalability.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-051-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-105-chunk-000</data>
