    <node id="Project Statugoan">
      <data key="d0">Project Statugoan</data>
      <data key="d1">project</data>
      <data key="d2">Project Statugoan is an initiative focused on customer onboarding flows with an approved budget of $5.8M. It is currently entering the implementation stage after completing the initial phase of user journey mapping.&lt;SEP&gt;An initiative led by Leveine Brarpil that is in a phase aligned with the Garelor Relay infrastructure review. It is expected to contribute insights for long-term sustainability and scalability.&lt;SEP&gt;An ongoing project under the stewardship of the Daslaor Applied Research Lab, discussed during the Strategic Planning and Operational Review Meeting. It is built on the Sestan Loom and is in a phase of scaling for broader implementation.&lt;SEP&gt;A strategic initiative at Zastama Industries aimed at enhancing fleet operations through advanced analytics and automated responses. It is being built on the Sestan Loom platform.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-052-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-094-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-105-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-057-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-052&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-094&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-105&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-057</data>
      <data key="d5">1793694974</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Cross-Departmental Review">
      <data key="d0">Cross-Departmental Review</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The cross-departmental review is a meeting hosted by Leveine Brarpil to align teams on Project Statugoan's budget allocation and resource planning. It is scheduled to take place the week after the email was sent.&lt;SEP&gt;A planned session at Zastama Industries to gather feedback on demand forecasting models from multiple departments.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-052-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-093-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-052&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-093</data>
      <data key="d5">1793664646</data>
