      <data key="d0">Geszea Tonzamnel</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A senior leader in Zastama Industries who receives direct reports from Burteor Vudiren.&lt;SEP&gt;A member of the Drurlomis Integration Team who reported on progress in aligning systems across departments and proposed a revised timeline for integration milestones.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual whose work has been instrumental in ensuring the Broltala Loom meets its performance benchmarks.&lt;SEP&gt;A person to whom Burteor Vudiren reports. They are not directly involved in the Garelor Relay infrastructure review but are part of the organizational hierarchy.&lt;SEP&gt;A key figure in customer operations at Zastama Industries, instrumental in streamlining onboarding flows and introducing an updated onboarding dashboard.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-053-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-077-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-095-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-094-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-109-chunk-000</data>
