      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Cross-Functional Partners are teams or departments within Zastama Industries that collaborate with the Project Medeis team to ensure all technical and regulatory requirements are being met.&lt;SEP&gt;Teams from different functional areas within Zastama Industries who collaborate with the Project Krindais team.</data>
