      <data key="d1">process</data>
      <data key="d2">A structured process being followed to evaluate potential disruptions to Project Thedraman, including operational, logistical, and financial risks.&lt;SEP&gt;A proposed standardized process to be adopted across departments for managing external uncertainties and unforeseen challenges.&lt;SEP&gt;A formal process established by the Project Krindais team to identify and mitigate operational and technical risks.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-exec-025-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-098-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-047-chunk-000</data>
