      <data key="d0">Integration Testing</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">A phase in the development of the Lorhia Loom where the core framework is being tested for compatibility and functionality.&lt;SEP&gt;A phase in the Mumteror Prism project where the project team is currently working to finalize system integration.&lt;SEP&gt;A phase in the development of Project Komsonor where platform components are tested for compatibility and performance, with feedback from internal review sessions.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_a-057-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-000-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-002-chunk-000</data>
