    <node id="Internal Reviews">
      <data key="d0">Internal Reviews</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Internal Reviews are the assessments conducted by teams to prepare for the renewal of the Bekuine Consulting contract.&lt;SEP&gt;A series of assessments planned for Q3 FY27 to confirm that all systems and protocols meet Zastama’s standards.&lt;SEP&gt;A series of reviews to be conducted by the Project Krindais team to confirm system functionality.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-088-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-114-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-047-chunk-000</data>
