    <node id="Resource Availability">
      <data key="d0">Resource Availability</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A factor affecting the implementation of Project Binroine, as the team balances ongoing assessments with new workflow integration.&lt;SEP&gt;Resource availability is a risk related to the project timeline, as it depends on the availability of a key internal resource whose schedule is fluid due to competing priorities.&lt;SEP&gt;The assessment of whether necessary resources are available for the final phase of Project Komsonor, including ongoing communication with external stakeholders.&lt;SEP&gt;The availability of necessary resources to support the execution of Project Krindais.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-072-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-024-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-017-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-047-chunk-000</data>
