      <data key="d5">1793757823</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Security">
      <data key="d0">Security</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The protection of systems and data from unauthorized access or threats. Enhancing security is a key objective of the identity and access tooling updates.&lt;SEP&gt;A shared focus area for both the Sabrinett Analytics Unit and the Drugoan Platform Group, aimed at improving system-wide protection.&lt;SEP&gt;Security refers to the protection of the Kusbosine Console from unauthorized access and threats, which is a key focus area for the maintenance team.&lt;SEP&gt;A key focus of the integration of the Ketemram Vault into Project Krindais.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-061-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-006-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-057-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-059-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-047-chunk-000</data>
