      <data key="d5">1793757823</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Data Integrity">
      <data key="d0">Data Integrity</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The accuracy and consistency of data in Dopusa Varesett's area of responsibility, which is being reviewed following an internal audit.&lt;SEP&gt;A primary objective of Project Lathonel, ensuring the accuracy and consistency of internal system data.&lt;SEP&gt;The accuracy and consistency of data, a shared goal between the Sabrinett Analytics Unit and the Drugoan Platform Group.&lt;SEP&gt;A core objective of Project Krindais, aimed at ensuring the accuracy and consistency of data.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_a-013-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-048-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-057-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-047-chunk-000</data>
