      <data key="d1">feature</data>
      <data key="d2">A capability being enhanced through telemetry integration with the Krorhitra Console to provide enterprise clients with up-to-date data insights.&lt;SEP&gt;An advanced feature included in the enterprise tier of Zastama Industries' product offerings.</data>
