    <node id="Communication Channels">
      <data key="d0">Communication Channels</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The internal systems for exchanging information between departments at Zastama Industries, which are being improved to support sustainable growth.&lt;SEP&gt;The established means through which stakeholders are regularly informed about the progress of key projects.&lt;SEP&gt;The planned system of clearer communication to be established within the team for improved coordination.&lt;SEP&gt;The means by which the Stonfe Analytics Unit interacts with other departments to support strategic projects.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-076-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-043-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-047-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-026-chunk-000</data>
