    <node id="Enterprise Customers">
      <data key="d0">Enterprise Customers</data>
      <data key="d1">customergroup</data>
      <data key="d2">A target market segment for Zastama Industries, particularly relevant to the Krorhitra Console and fleet telemetry. These clients are expected to benefit from advanced analytics and integration features.&lt;SEP&gt;Customers who use the enterprise tier of Zastama Industries' product offerings and will benefit from the integration of the Ketemram Vault.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-068-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-047-chunk-000</data>
