      <data key="d0">System Validation</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A process being implemented at Zastama Industries to ensure the reliability and correctness of system integrations.&lt;SEP&gt;A process to confirm that a system meets its intended requirements and functions correctly. The focus for the Lozenor Lattice will shift to this in the coming period.</data>
