    <node id="Zerfuan Thasdaett">
      <data key="d0">Zerfuan Thasdaett</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A researcher at the Daslaor Applied Research Lab who is responsible for preparing reports on data transmission experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;Zerfuan Thasdaett is an individual who directly oversees Project Vumzosa and has an established working relationship with Kosnaren Systems. They provide assessments and recommendations regarding project performance, contract renewals, and resource allocation.&lt;SEP&gt;An employee at Zastama Industries who reports directly to Givien Mubren.&lt;SEP&gt;Leads a critical review of internal systems at Zastama Industries to identify bottlenecks and opportunities for automation.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-056-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-058-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-067-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-081-chunk-000</data>
