    <node id="Gehoel Karherel">
      <data key="d0">Gehoel Karherel</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A researcher at the Daslaor Applied Research Lab who leads a review of the Zoluna Data Center’s environmental impact and energy usage.&lt;SEP&gt;A team member who focuses on customer onboarding flows and has been vital in identifying bottlenecks and opportunities for improvement.&lt;SEP&gt;A key member of the Drugoan Platform Group who focuses on customer onboarding flows. Gehoel Karherel designs and refines the processes that new customers go through when adopting the company’s platforms and services.&lt;SEP&gt;An employee at Zastama Industries who discussed updates to customer onboarding processes and proposed a new internal checklist system.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-056-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-060-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-086-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-107-chunk-000</data>
