    <node id="Engineering Lead">
      <data key="d0">Engineering Lead</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A leader in the engineering department who confirms the current capacity of the Tanumett Relay and discusses potential expansion plans.&lt;SEP&gt;The Engineering Lead provides updates on the progress of engineering projects, including Project Mennamett and Project Golgoett, and ensures alignment with projected schedules.&lt;SEP&gt;A representative from the engineering department who provided an update on the supply chain for the Bozilron Ledger project.&lt;SEP&gt;The individual overseeing the next round of system tuning for Project Tukrama.&lt;SEP&gt;A representative from the engineering department who participated in the meeting.&lt;SEP&gt;The Engineering Lead is a person responsible for providing technical context and coordinating the development of updated documentation for the Lozeine Applied Research Lab's incident response protocols.&lt;SEP&gt;A person responsible for leading the engineering team and conducting evaluations of the project's development and dependencies.</data>
