      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Calendar Invite is a digital invitation sent to schedule the 30-minute Sync meeting between Zosne Bramfa and the Finance Lead.&lt;SEP&gt;A Calendar Invite is a digital notification used to schedule the coordination session for reviewing access protocols related to the Zitrien Partners contract.&lt;SEP&gt;A digital or physical invitation to the meeting, to be sent out by Pethisa Hebroren.&lt;SEP&gt;A planned communication to schedule the working session for finalizing the revised access control framework.&lt;SEP&gt;A digital invitation to the cross-functional meeting for Project Golgoett, to be sent by Gonnom Gosmunza to coordinate the timing and logistics of the meeting.</data>
