      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The network of suppliers and vendors, including Dapoan Consulting and Halrurine Logistics, that provide components for the Sestan Loom.&lt;SEP&gt;The network of suppliers and logistics involved in the Bozilron Ledger project, with Nerasan Labs being a critical component.&lt;SEP&gt;The network of processes and entities involved in delivering components for the Temgumel Prism, with potential overlaps and dependencies with Project Lathonel.&lt;SEP&gt;Supply Chain refers to the system through which components are sourced and delivered by Mortalis Consulting for the Mumteror Prism project.</data>
