      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A classification within Zastama Industries' product suite, currently assigned to the Tanumett Relay. It is being reviewed for potential repositioning based on user growth and feature adoption.&lt;SEP&gt;A classification level confirmed for Zasdaett Harbor to accommodate delivery timelines.&lt;SEP&gt;A classification indicating the access level provided by the Zasdaett Harbor location.&lt;SEP&gt;A defined level of service offering for the Zasdaett Harbor, which is being assessed for potential expansion without compromising its integrity.&lt;SEP&gt;A level of service at Zastama Industries that now includes the Brapoett Vault, reflecting the company's commitment to delivering robust and scalable solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Standard Tier is the category under which the Lorhia Loom is offered, indicating a balanced mix of functionality and cost-effectiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;A product offering of the Samopunel Beacon, which is being refined to ensure it meets customer expectations and aligns with the company's product roadmap.</data>
