      <data key="d0">Tanla Terlusvi</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A Staff Engineer at Zastama Industries who has contributed significantly to the development of the Lozenor Lattice and systems built upon it.&lt;SEP&gt;The project lead for Project Zasmemine, responsible for managing customer onboarding workflows and coordinating corrective actions related to audit findings.&lt;SEP&gt;Tanla Terlusvi is the supervisor of Losmais Zoslesine at Zastama Industries. They oversee her performance, access permissions, and approve any changes to her responsibilities or access rights.&lt;SEP&gt;A person who submitted a procurement order and is responsible for uploading the finalized invoice to the procurement portal.&lt;SEP&gt;Tanla Terlusvi is a Staff Engineer who has been with the company since 2013. She has contributed valuable insights to the infrastructure strategy and has been critical in several phases of the Natrala Relay development.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-065-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-009-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-021-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-040-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-083-chunk-000</data>
