    <node id="Identity and Access Management">
      <data key="d0">Identity and Access Management</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Identity and Access Management is a core focus area of the Zugula Infrastructure Team. It involves managing access controls and authentication protocols to ensure the security of internal systems and data.&lt;SEP&gt;Identity and Access Management refers to the system-wide authentication processes, role-based access control, and secure user experiences managed by Zunhu Kusasteis.&lt;SEP&gt;A set of initiatives focused on improving the security and efficiency of user authentication processes at Zastama Industries.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-066-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-011-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-019-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-066&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-011&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-019</data>
      <data key="d5">1793685349</data>
