    </node>
    <node id="Pobraor Tosaett">
      <data key="d0">Pobraor Tosaett</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Pobraor Tosaett is a UX Researcher working on the warehouse automation initiative within the Zugula Infrastructure Team. Their role involves understanding user needs and behavior to improve the usability of automation systems.&lt;SEP&gt;A team member at Zastama Industries who translates demand forecasting models into actionable insights for operational planning and leads the data analysis component of model reviews.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual who is following up on compliance documentation for the Kralinan Data Center and is providing summaries of operational and vendor-related information to support the audit process.&lt;SEP&gt;A person who attended the meeting and confirmed that his team had reviewed the access protocols for the system in question. Pobraor Tosaett is associated with an access badge series CP-4865-H.&lt;SEP&gt;A valued member of Zastama Industries since 2018, associated with cost center XU-3673-G. Their role is instrumental in maintaining the integrity and efficiency of this cost center and is a key component of the company's operational structure.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-066-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-093-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-022-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-039-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-056-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-066&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-093&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-022&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-039&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-056</data>
      <data key="d5">1793672850</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="UX Researcher">
      <data key="d0">UX Researcher</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">UX Researcher is a role within the Zugula Infrastructure Team, specifically held by Pobraor Tosaett. It involves conducting research to understand user needs and behavior in order to improve the design and usability of systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-066-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-066</data>
      <data key="d5">1793660399</data>
      <data key="d6" />
