    <node id="Internal Operations">
      <data key="d0">Internal Operations</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Internal Operations refers to the day-to-day functions and systems within Zastama Industries that are supported and maintained by the Zugula Infrastructure Team.&lt;SEP&gt;A department responsible for the internal operational aspects of Project Dremtona.&lt;SEP&gt;The day-to-day activities and processes within Zastama Industries that are supported by the delivery of the new equipment.&lt;SEP&gt;The day-to-day activities and functions within Zastama Industries, which are expected to benefit from the outcomes of Project Minkegais.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-066-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-023-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-030-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-099-chunk-000</data>
