    <node id="Infrastructure Strategy">
      <data key="d0">Infrastructure Strategy</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Infrastructure Strategy is the overarching plan and direction of the Zugula Infrastructure Team. It includes initiatives such as identity and access management and warehouse automation, which are central to supporting business growth and operational efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Infrastructure Strategy refers to the long-term plan for developing and maintaining the technical systems and tools that support organizational operations. It is a focus area for Zastama Industries and the Zugula Infrastructure Team.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-066-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-083-chunk-000</data>
