      <data key="d2">A process being reviewed and improved for the Sallama Lattice to enhance user retention and satisfaction. It involves identifying areas for improvement and streamlining the user experience.&lt;SEP&gt;User Onboarding is the process of integrating new users into the Zasdaett Harbor system, with a focus on minimizing friction and maximizing early engagement.&lt;SEP&gt;User Onboarding is the process being planned for the Dronmeman Beacon to prepare users for its launch and ensure they are ready to utilize the new system.</data>
