      <data key="d0">Cross-Functional Review</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">A collaborative process involving multiple departments or teams to ensure alignment with long-term goals. This has been used to support progress on the Natrala Relay.&lt;SEP&gt;An upcoming phase in Project Nondaran involving a collaborative evaluation of the procurement order and its alignment with budget constraints.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-084-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-036-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-084&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-036</data>
