      <data key="d0">Cross-Functional Stakeholders</data>
      <data key="d1">group</data>
      <data key="d2">Individuals or groups from different departments or teams who have an interest in the success of a project. These stakeholders will support the final system validation of the Lozenor Lattice.&lt;SEP&gt;Cross-Functional Stakeholders are individuals or groups from different departments or functions within Zastama Industries who provide input on the Brapoett Vault project.&lt;SEP&gt;A group of individuals or teams from different functional areas within the organization who are working closely with the Project Dernelnar team to ensure proposed modifications do not compromise existing systems or user experience.</data>
