      <data key="d0">End of the Month</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The End of the Month is the deadline for Dronoan Bolgesan to finalize updated reconciliation reports for integration into the audit process.&lt;SEP&gt;The end of the month is the target date for the Strategic Resource Allocation Team to coordinate a meeting with stakeholders to solidify alignment between the Dronmeman Beacon and Zasdaett Harbor developments.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-085-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-001-chunk-000</data>
