    </node>
    <node id="Compliance Requirements">
      <data key="d0">Compliance Requirements</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Compliance Requirements are the standards and regulations that must be met for the successful completion of Project Mennamett.&lt;SEP&gt;Standards that the Trehaett Applied Research Lab must meet to ensure Project Monnoheor adheres to internal and external regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulatory standards that must be met for Project Krabehien's procurement and implementation.&lt;SEP&gt;Standards that the proposed tools must meet for integration with the Kusbosine Console.&lt;SEP&gt;Internal standards that access protocols must meet, as emphasized during the meeting.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-085-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-119-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-036-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-054-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-004-chunk-000</data>
