      <data key="d5">1793698601</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Financial Transparency">
      <data key="d0">Financial Transparency</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Financial Transparency is the principle of maintaining openness and clarity in all financial processes, as emphasized by the Finance Representative.&lt;SEP&gt;Financial Transparency is a concept that refers to the clarity and openness in financial reporting and management, which is a focus area for upcoming reviews and audits of the Krafuline Field Office.&lt;SEP&gt;The state of clear and accurate financial reporting, which Vosaett Neldelis has helped maintain through her work on reconciliations.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-085-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-025-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-043-chunk-000</data>
