      <data key="d0">Integration Strategies</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A set of approaches used by the Drurlomis Integration Team to evaluate and implement the integration of new technologies and systems into the company’s existing infrastructure.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-086-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-086</data>
      <data key="d5">1793663695</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Risk Assessments">
      <data key="d0">Risk Assessments</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A process conducted by the Drurlomis Integration Team to evaluate potential challenges and ensure that integration activities are conducted with minimal disruption.&lt;SEP&gt;Ongoing evaluations being conducted for Project Krabehien to identify potential bottlenecks or external factors that could delay progress.&lt;SEP&gt;A process used to evaluate potential risks in the Maslarine Compass project, particularly in relation to access control and documentation.&lt;SEP&gt;Ongoing evaluations conducted during the Q2 Technical Integration Project to identify and address potential risks, particularly related to communication and vendor dependencies.&lt;SEP&gt;Evaluations conducted as part of the compliance review cycle to identify and address potential risks in the Maslarine Compass project.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-086-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-013-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-052-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-009-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-053-chunk-000</data>
