      <data key="d0">Fuvaine Palnoine</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A member of the Thellusen Applied Research Lab who has been integral to the development of Project Lovulett.&lt;SEP&gt;An employee at Zastama Industries based at the Lelosis Field Office who noted the potential integration of lab findings with field operations.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual responsible for identity and access tooling, working on initiatives related to Project Golgoett and Zasdaett Harbor. Fuvaine Palnoine has access badge series GG-7598-K and budget code DX-5110-V.&lt;SEP&gt;A finance representative who participated in the meeting, confirmed reporting structure, and will provide financial oversight for user engagement initiatives and team structure reviews.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-090-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-107-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-006-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-037-chunk-000</data>
