      <data key="d2">A digital platform used by Zastama Industries for submitting updates and communicating internally.&lt;SEP&gt;A new platform being rolled out to support seamless information sharing between teams and leadership.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-096-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-113-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-096&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-113</data>
      <data key="d5">1793666835</data>
