    </node>
    <node id="Follow-Up Meeting">
      <data key="d0">Follow-Up Meeting</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Follow-Up Meeting is a recurring or scheduled event designed to review progress, address concerns, and ensure alignment across various initiatives within Zastama Industries. These meetings are typically organized by key stakeholders such as the Operations Lead, finance representative, or project management office (PMO), depending on the specific focus area. One such meeting is scheduled for April 17, 2025, to review revised forecasts and assess budget alignment, organized by the finance representative. Another instance is set for April 17 to examine the status of a procurement order and the outcome of a security review, involving Tanla Terlusvi, the PMO, and security teams to review an audit report and outline a remediation plan.

The Follow-Up Meeting also serves as a platform to discuss the status of procurement orders and ensure that deliverables are being tracked appropriately. In the context of Project Zothoris, it is used to review progress on action items and address any emerging concerns. Additionally, these meetings are employed to evaluate vendor dependency issues and assess the viability of alternative support options. They also cover technical aspects, such as reviewing the technical integration plan and addressing any changes to the tooling’s functionality. Collectively, these meetings play a critical role in maintaining operational clarity, accountability, and strategic alignment across departments and projects.&lt;SEP&gt;Follow-Up Meeting is a planned meeting between Krosso Velfosan, Zondila Krerraris, and representatives from the Site Reliability Engineering Group to assess the progress of reconciliation and procurement activities and to develop a unified action plan for any outstanding issues.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-public-096-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-021-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-024-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-031-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-009-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-025-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-037-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-032-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-023-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-public-096&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-021&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-024&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-031&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-009&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-025&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-037&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-032&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-023</data>
      <data key="d5">1793758715</data>
      <data key="d6" />
