    <node id="Internal Systems">
      <data key="d0">Internal Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">system</data>
      <data key="d2">Internal Systems are digital tools or platforms used within the company for various operational functions, including the customer onboarding process. Recent updates to these systems were discussed in the meeting.&lt;SEP&gt;The systems Lenhoa Trakrean needs full visibility into to perform her role effectively.&lt;SEP&gt;The set of systems within Zastama Industries that are being integrated as part of Project Lathonel.&lt;SEP&gt;Internal Systems are the digital platforms and tools used by Zastama Industries to support employee roles, including those of Losmais Zoslesine, by granting access to necessary resources.</data>
