    <node id="Cross-Team Communication">
      <data key="d0">Cross-Team Communication</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Cross-Team Communication refers to the exchange of information and coordination between different teams within the company. It was reviewed as part of internal process optimization initiatives.&lt;SEP&gt;The interaction and coordination between different teams within Zastama Industries, which is being addressed through weekly meetings to avoid delays.&lt;SEP&gt;Cross-Team Communication is a method used by the Lozeine Applied Research Lab to facilitate information exchange and coordination between different teams during incident response.</data>
