    <node id="Donnoett Loom">
      <data key="d0">Donnoett Loom</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Donnoett Loom is a central system within Zastama Industries' infrastructure modernization initiative, currently serving its intended role with stable performance. It is being developed and deployed by the Thanfuan Applied Research Lab and is in the final phase of internal testing and deployment. The system is configured with custom parameters to support Project Tukrama’s automation needs and is designed to streamline an internal support function as part of an internal-only tier offering under development at Zastama Industries.

Donnoett Loom is maintained internally and not subject to external vendor dependencies, ensuring control and flexibility in its operation. It is currently in the final integration phase for a scheduled launch in Q1 FY26, with all subsystems having passed internal validation and the project on track for its planned timeline. The system has a user base of approximately 4,700 active users, and recent feature rollouts and user feedback have been discussed in internal meetings. It is the focus of ongoing planning for access control, user engagement, and product updates.

In addition to its internal development and deployment, Donnoett Loom is undergoing hardware upgrades under procurement order LR-6795-G. The project also holds potential infrastructure planning value for Project Zothoris, indicating its broader strategic importance within Zastama Industries.&lt;SEP&gt;A system or device hosted at the Tupalhasa Field Office that is being developed and maintained as part of ongoing operations.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_a-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-016-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-020-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-026-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-039-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-049-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-037-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-038-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-035-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-team_a-001&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-016&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-020&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-026&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-039&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-049&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-037&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-038&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-035</data>
      <data key="d5">1793698122</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
