    <node id="Bomekraen Infrastructure Team">
      <data key="d0">Bomekraen Infrastructure Team</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Bomekraen Infrastructure Team is a group engaged in assessing the feasibility of expanding automation protocols across a warehouse network. They operate under contract number GU-4932-D and are focused on streamlining logistics and improving operational efficiency in the region.&lt;SEP&gt;A team at Zastama Industries responsible for maintaining access protocols for the Lorhia Loom.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bomekraen Infrastructure Team is a group within Zastama Industries responsible for managing infrastructure-related projects, including Project Dremtona. They operate under a $7.2M annual budget.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_a-002-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-016-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-015-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-team_a-002&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-016&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-015</data>
