    </node>
    <node id="Getaine Hebruen">
      <data key="d0">Getaine Hebruen</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Getaine Hebruen is a member of the Bomekraen Infrastructure Team, operating under contract number QC-9910-K. She has been instrumental in evaluating warehouse automation solutions, analyzing infrastructure limitations, and providing recommendations for modernization.&lt;SEP&gt;A team lead or manager who confirms the necessity of Kestoen Pismiett’s access to secured storage and coordinates with the Security Operations Manager.&lt;SEP&gt;A team member providing updates on warehouse automation initiatives and interlinked projects, including Project Krabehien.&lt;SEP&gt;The director of the Thanfuan Applied Research Lab, responsible for overseeing the development and deployment of the Donnoett Loom system and coordinating with internal stakeholders.</data>
