    <node id="April 3, 2025">
      <data key="d0">April 3, 2025</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">April 3, 2025, is a date marked by multiple internal meetings and reviews across various departments and projects. It was the day on which the Operations Review Meeting was held, providing an opportunity to assess ongoing operations and performance. Additionally, the Q1 FY26 Project Update and Escrow Verification Meeting was convened, focusing on project progress and financial safeguards.

On this date, several project-specific meetings took place. The meeting to discuss the budget and audit follow-up for Project Stepoen was held, as was the Project Pomtorgi budget review meeting. Another session reviewed audit findings and planned corrective actions, while a separate meeting addressed the status of Project Sankonen and outlined next steps.

April 3, 2025, also saw the internal strategy review meeting involving the Zizadal Infrastructure Team and key project updates. This was complemented by the Strategy and Project Update Meeting, where strategic priorities and project status were reviewed, with a particular focus on Project Medeis and the Brapoett Vault. A strategic planning session was also held, reinforcing the day's emphasis on strategic alignment and project oversight.

Other notable meetings on this date included the Femfasel Vault Access and Escrow Review Meeting and the internal meeting at Zastama Industries. A meeting to discuss audit findings and access review was also conducted, highlighting the importance of compliance and security protocols.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_a-004-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-039-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-059-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-027-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-031-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-042-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-045-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-054-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-005-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-007-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-029-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-037-chunk-000</data>
