    <node id="Niparor Tamsola">
      <data key="d0">Niparor Tamsola</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Niparor Tamsola is an Operations Manager at the Krafuline Field Office who has initiated procurement order QK-5662-N. They have a history of submitting well-documented and justified procurement requests and have demonstrated a strong understanding of the company's procurement procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;Niparor Tamsola works as an Operations Manager and has contributed to the project by managing logistics and resource planning. His team has implemented process optimizations to improve efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Niparor Tamsola is the Operations Manager at the Krafuline Field Office. They manage day-to-day operations, including personnel coordination, vendor management, project execution, and workflow efficiency. They also collaborate with Staski Rakresett to align financial and operational priorities.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_a-006-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-024-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-025-chunk-000</data>
