    <node id="Krafuline Field Office">
      <data key="d0">Krafuline Field Office</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Krafuline Field Office is a geographic location where Niparor Tamsola is employed as an Operations Manager. It is the location associated with the procurement order and cost center GL-5822-U.&lt;SEP&gt;The Krafuline Field Office is a primary site operated by Zastama Industries in a coastal region. It functions as a key regional hub for the company, supporting on-site and remote activities while ensuring compliance with internal protocols and external regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;A field office operated under contract number PS-2577-A, responsible for asset management, data collection, and serving as a point of contact for vendors and auditors.&lt;SEP&gt;A field office opened in 2010, with a capacity for 560 seats but currently operating below 80% utilization, and undergoing a mid-year budget review.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_a-006-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-025-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-035-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-057-chunk-000</data>
