      <data key="d2">A project currently in its initial implementation phase, with active compliance and budgetary tracking. It is assigned cost center HF-4564-S and is progressing without material delays.&lt;SEP&gt;A foundational system or platform on which Project Zothoris is built, scheduled for launch in Q1 FY27.&lt;SEP&gt;An upcoming infrastructure initiative that is separate from the Kralinan Data Center but will rely on it as a foundational resource once it launches in Q1 FY27.&lt;SEP&gt;A physical or digital object requiring installation as part of Project Tosven, with a vault key ID of CL-9764-L.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_a-009-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-021-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-022-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-038-chunk-000</data>
