    <node id="Pelron Loshoan">
      <data key="d0">Pelron Loshoan</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Compliance Officer responsible for overseeing compliance and budgetary aspects of the Nomzamel Lattice. Has escrow reference BA-6228-B and budget code JZ-6764-D.&lt;SEP&gt;A Compliance Officer who is coordinating the access review for Braveor Fabrication renewal.&lt;SEP&gt;The Compliance Officer assigned specific responsibilities regarding the Maslarine Compass, tasked with reviewing and approving all project documentation to ensure compliance with internal policies and regulatory standards.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_a-009-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-012-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-053-chunk-000</data>
