    <node id="Compliance Report">
      <data key="d0">Compliance Report</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A document prepared by Pelron Loshoan confirming the correct application of the allocated budget and compliance with internal controls.&lt;SEP&gt;The Compliance Report is an updated document to be submitted by the project team in mid-May, summarizing audit responses and including a revised risk assessment.&lt;SEP&gt;The Compliance Report is a formal document being prepared by the compliance team at Zastama Industries to evaluate the status of the Zitrien Partners contract, including risk factors and compliance findings.</data>
