      <data key="d0">Escrow Reference</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A reference code (BA-6228-B) associated with Pelron Loshoan for tracking compliance and budgetary responsibilities.&lt;SEP&gt;A financial reference number used to align financial instruments with procurement deliverables.&lt;SEP&gt;Escrow Reference is a securely archived reference used during the final stages of migration processes. It is associated with Mukima Bobrior and is used in key infrastructure management.&lt;SEP&gt;A reference used in documentation and external communication for the Femfasel Vault. The escrow reference is QG-5178-X.</data>
