    <node id="Mesgum Sestim">
      <data key="d0">Mesgum Sestim</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A team lead who is involved in reviewing incident response tooling for Braveor Fabrication.&lt;SEP&gt;Mesgum Sestim is a person overseeing the integration of the KU-9802-C budget code into the internal tracking system and managing the vault associated with key ID CK-8867-C.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual at Zastama Industries who has recently focused on incident response tooling. Their work is important for refining the company's approach to system resilience and incident mitigation, and they collaborate with stakeholders to enhance detection, response, and recovery from operational disruptions.&lt;SEP&gt;A subject-matter expert focused on incident response tooling, who evaluates, tests, and recommends tools for integration into Zastama Industries' cybersecurity architecture.</data>
