      <data key="d2">A process to verify that access permissions for Braveor Fabrication are compliant with current protocols.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of evaluating and potentially modifying access privileges for personnel in Project Lathonel.&lt;SEP&gt;An evaluation of access control systems and protocols to ensure proper tracking and management of both digital and physical access.&lt;SEP&gt;A process conducted by the Compliance and Access Control Office to verify access protocols and ensure alignment with role-based access policies.</data>
