    <node id="Zosne Bramfa">
      <data key="d0">Zosne Bramfa</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Zosne Bramfa is an individual involved in payment reconciliation and budget alignment for the Kralinan Data Center. They are responsible for identifying and addressing misallocations in cost centers and vendor-related charges.&lt;SEP&gt;Zosne Bramfa is an individual involved in internal discussions regarding the Zitrien Partners contract and access credentials. They are following up on the contract review and coordinating with the finance and access control teams.&lt;SEP&gt;A person to whom Zelpean Henfurel reports. Zosne Bramfa is expected to receive a brief update from Zelpean Henfurel summarizing her workload and identifying potential bottlenecks.&lt;SEP&gt;A leader who oversees strategic cybersecurity initiatives at Zastama Industries and receives regular updates from Mesgum Sestim.&lt;SEP&gt;A Staff Engineer who offered technical insights into the compatibility of the proposed identity and access tools with existing authentication protocols and emphasized the importance of scalability and collaboration between procurement and IT engineering.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_a-011-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-017-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-018-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-014-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-032-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-team_a-011&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-017&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-018&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-014&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-032</data>
