    </node>
    <node id="Kralinan Data Center">
      <data key="d0">Kralinan Data Center</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Kralinan Data Center is a physical location where data center operations and maintenance activities are conducted. It is the subject of budget alignment and cost center reallocation discussions.&lt;SEP&gt;A data center where equipment is being delivered and integrated as part of the Mepoen Consulting engagement.&lt;SEP&gt;A data center facility that has been operational since 2021 and is currently under review for escrow compliance. It is expected to serve as a foundational resource for the Nomzamel Lattice infrastructure.&lt;SEP&gt;A geographic location where equipment for Project Tosven is being delivered.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_a-011-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-019-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-022-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-045-chunk-000</data>
