    <node id="Budget Alignment">
      <data key="d0">Budget Alignment</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Budget Alignment is a process aimed at ensuring that financial allocations match the actual scope of work and contractual obligations, particularly for the Kralinan Data Center.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of ensuring that financial resources are allocated appropriately for the Mumteror Prism project.&lt;SEP&gt;Budget Alignment is the process of ensuring that departmental budgets are in line with company-wide strategic goals. It was the central theme of the strategic planning session.&lt;SEP&gt;A process being monitored to ensure Project Hinzosine remains within its approved budget.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_a-011-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-000-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-037-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-042-chunk-000</data>
