    <node id="Budget Reallocation">
      <data key="d0">Budget Reallocation</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Budget Reallocation is the process of adjusting financial allocations to correct misattributed charges and ensure alignment with contractual obligations and actual expenses.&lt;SEP&gt;Budget Reallocation is a process being coordinated with the finance lead to finalize funding for upcoming infrastructure modernization efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;Budget Reallocation is the potential adjustment of the Bomekraen Infrastructure Team's $7.2M annual budget to better align with current priorities or unforeseen needs, particularly in relation to Project Dremtona.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_a-011-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-056-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-015-chunk-000</data>
