    <node id="Project Krabehien">
      <data key="d0">Project Krabehien</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A medium-scale initiative staffed by 20 people across multiple departments, aimed at improving fleet telemetry systems. It is currently in the implementation phase and is a key initiative in the near-term strategic development roadmap of Zastama Industries.&lt;SEP&gt;An ongoing high-priority initiative within Zastama Industries focused on compliance and engineering collaboration.&lt;SEP&gt;A project related to staffing and automation, with a current team of 20 people and a need for infrastructure planning.&lt;SEP&gt;A project managed by a team of 20 people, currently in the integration phase of the Temgumel Prism into its core systems. It is progressing along the initial planning timelines and is tracked under cost center GB-7497-D and procurement order WM-1603-F.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_a-013-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-036-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-037-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-044-chunk-000</data>
