      <data key="d0">Dopusa Varesett</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A senior-level professional at Zastama Industries whose primary focus is on fleet telemetry. She is engaged in telemetry data integration and is a key point of contact for cross-functional teams. She has been involved in an internal audit and has a vault key ID of LP-3408-A.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual involved in the communication and handling of the audit finding related to Krolpumen Labs. They are coordinating with the finance lead and ensuring audit tracking is updated.&lt;SEP&gt;A project team member leading the telemetry framework for Project Stepoen and responsible for addressing audit concerns related to data integration.&lt;SEP&gt;A professional focusing on fleet telemetry, playing a key role in ensuring the Maslarine Compass integrates effectively with existing fleet systems and coordinating with a vendor for field trials.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_a-013-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-034-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-058-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-053-chunk-000</data>
