      <data key="d0">Internal Audit</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">An audit conducted within Zastama Industries that uncovered findings related to Dopusa Varesett's responsibilities. The audit finding ID is QZ-7654-Q.&lt;SEP&gt;A process conducted by the finance team to verify that all transactions and charges are properly categorized and documented.&lt;SEP&gt;Internal audit is a function within the organization responsible for reviewing and ensuring compliance with internal policies and procedures. In this context, documentation on vault key ID access reviews will be submitted to internal audit by April 17.&lt;SEP&gt;A scheduled review of the Nunvaine Lattice project's documentation, including the escrow reference VE-6820-R, to ensure compliance and readiness.&lt;SEP&gt;A review of Mortalis Consulting’s financial terms conducted by the Contract Management Team.&lt;SEP&gt;Internal audits may be conducted to confirm that all procedures for the Gahikron Campus procurement order are being followed in line with company policy.&lt;SEP&gt;An ongoing process at Zastama Industries to review contracts and cost center allocations as part of resource reallocation and organizational alignment.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_a-013-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-013-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-042-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-048-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-023-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-052-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-010-chunk-000</data>
