    <node id="Lorhia Loom">
      <data key="d0">Lorhia Loom</data>
      <data key="d1">product</data>
      <data key="d2">A system at Zastama Industries that requires access control review and compliance improvements.&lt;SEP&gt;A major initiative within Zastama Industries that is on schedule for a Q2 FY26 launch. It involves completing the core framework and undergoing integration testing.&lt;SEP&gt;A standard-tier offering of Zastama Industries, Inc. affected by the Vonnusett Lattice audit finding.&lt;SEP&gt;Lorhia Loom is a platform with approximately 8,900 active users. The platform is undergoing a phased expansion of features in response to user feedback, and the Zizadal Infrastructure Team is being consulted for a long-term scalability review.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lorhia Loom is a standard-tier offering that supports an active user base of approximately 8,900 users. It is designed to provide a balanced mix of functionality and cost-effectiveness.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_a-016-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-057-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-031-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-042-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-034-chunk-000</data>
