      <data key="d0">Staski Rakresett</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Staski Rakresett is the Finance Lead who is reviewing the Zitrien Partners contract and confirming access credentials. They are responsible for ensuring financial terms align with expectations and for maintaining access permissions.&lt;SEP&gt;Staski Rakresett is the Finance Lead at the Krafuline Field Office. They are responsible for all financial aspects of the office, including budget oversight, expense tracking, coordination with the main finance team, and managing the escrow account tied to the LG-3425-W reference.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual who initiated the communication regarding the audit finding and is coordinating with the finance team to address the issue with Krolpumen Labs.&lt;SEP&gt;Staski Rakresett is the Finance Lead at Zastama Industries, overseeing financial aspects of the engagement with Mepoen Consulting, including budget allocation, payment approvals, and coordination of the financial review.</data>
