      <data key="d0">Zitrien Partners</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Zitrien Partners is an organization with which a $3.7M contract is being reviewed. The contract is under internal assessment and involves coordination of access credentials and financial terms.&lt;SEP&gt;Zitrien Partners is an organization that has a contract with Zastama Industries, specifically a $3.7M contract. The contract is the subject of a reconciliation process between the procurement order and the final invoice.&lt;SEP&gt;A critical vendor in the cybersecurity domain, working closely with Zastama Industries' incident response team to develop and implement tools and frameworks for threat detection and mitigation.&lt;SEP&gt;Zitrien Partners is a key vendor in Zastama Industries' current portfolio, with an active contract valued at $3.7M. The project is under review to ensure alignment with internal compliance standards.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_a-017-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-030-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-014-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-028-chunk-000</data>
