    <node id="Internal Protocols">
      <data key="d0">Internal Protocols</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Internal Protocols are the established procedures and guidelines that Zastama Industries follows to ensure compliance and consistency in the operations of its field offices, including the Krafuline Field Office.&lt;SEP&gt;The established procedures and guidelines that must be followed by all personnel in Project Lathonel to ensure compliance and security.&lt;SEP&gt;Procedures within the Lozeine Applied Research Lab that have been revised based on Megen Tissefam's insights to streamline communication and testing phases between Project Dernelnar and the Zartesis Prism.&lt;SEP&gt;The established procedures and guidelines that the Maslarine Compass project must follow to ensure compliance with Zastama Industries' internal policies.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_a-025-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-048-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-044-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-053-chunk-000</data>
