    <node id="Budget Variance">
      <data key="d0">Budget Variance</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The difference between projected and actual financial outcomes, which the Finance Lead advises should be considered when evaluating new terms with Stivois Partners.&lt;SEP&gt;Budget Variance is the difference between budget projections and actual expenditures, currently within acceptable parameters for the current quarter.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_a-029-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-033-chunk-000</data>
