      <data key="d2">Staff Engineer refining demand forecasting models for Project Krabehien.&lt;SEP&gt;Losmais Zoslesine is an employee of Zastama Industries who joined in 2023. She is currently integrated into her role and has been assigned access credentials and reporting lines. She operates under the supervision of Tanla Terlusvi and has been issued a vault key for controlled storage access.&lt;SEP&gt;Losmais Zoslesine is a project team member who joined the company in 2023. She provided an update on the progress of Project Medeis, confirmed it is on schedule to meet its Q2 FY27 completion target, and emphasized the need for continued collaboration with the finance and legal teams.&lt;SEP&gt;A new team member who joined the company in 2023 and is contributing to strategic planning and cross-functional collaboration within Project Ruzonine. Her role is still being finalized.&lt;SEP&gt;A Project Lead at Zastama Industries, responsible for Project Laguran. Joined the company in 2023 and has been involved in cross-functional collaboration and managing interdependent projects.</data>
