    <node id="Vault Key">
      <data key="d0">Vault Key</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A physical key used to access secure storage units, such as the MD-1859-N key possessed by Momoma Gegarruel.&lt;SEP&gt;A key used to access secure systems, which is subject to audit findings and access control reviews.&lt;SEP&gt;The vault key is a key component of the Zartesis Prism project, assigned the ID AR-1355-J. It is essential for secure access to the project's primary data repository and must be handled with the highest level of confidentiality.&lt;SEP&gt;The Vault Key is a physical or digital access credential used to access the secure vault where Project Barkil's internal documentation is stored.&lt;SEP&gt;A cryptographic key used to access secure systems or data, such as the telemetry systems at Gahikron Campus.&lt;SEP&gt;A key associated with the Dronmeman Beacon, with ID AD-8734-S, discussed for secure storage and access protocols.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_a-048-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_a-051-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-025-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-059-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-035-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-041-chunk-000</data>
