      <data key="d0">Vonnusett Lattice</data>
      <data key="d1">project</data>
      <data key="d2">A lattice infrastructure hosted at the Brokamis Campus, currently supported by available capacity and access control systems.&lt;SEP&gt;An audit finding (ID ZK-9104-W) concerning a process-related discrepancy in documentation and verification of vendor contracts.&lt;SEP&gt;A platform with 4,100 active users that is demonstrating strong engagement. It has undergone a major software update and is currently performing within acceptable thresholds.</data>
