    <node id="Brokamis Campus">
      <data key="d0">Brokamis Campus</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">A physical location hosting the Vonnusett Lattice infrastructure, with a total capacity of 390 seats, 84% of which are currently occupied.&lt;SEP&gt;A physical location where access control and security systems are being reviewed as part of the audit and access review.&lt;SEP&gt;A geographic location where infrastructure upgrades are being planned, particularly in the area of identity and access management.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_b-002-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-054-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-032-chunk-000</data>
