      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Nosos Nikeis">
      <data key="d0">Nosos Nikeis</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Nosos Nikeis is a Site Reliability Lead at Zastama Industries who joined the company in 2024. She is primarily responsible for ensuring the stability and availability of infrastructure systems, coordinating with engineering teams on deployment and incident management, defining reliability benchmarks, and leading post-mortem analyses. In this role, she has confirmed updates to digital access systems, including the access control system for vault access, and acknowledged the need for better cross-checking between digital and physical access records.

Nosos Nikeis has been involved in multiple projects, including Project Drutoett, where she oversees infrastructure deployment and system stability monitoring. She has also supported Project Renbomen by confirming its status and proposing a review of disaster recovery protocols. Additionally, she has contributed to Project Pomtorgi by raising concerns about data latency and drafting a preliminary report on onboarding and integration practices for the task force.

Beyond her technical responsibilities, she has been assigned to a specialized role supporting Project Kososett, focusing on vendor coordination and internal compliance. She has also provided insights into recent changes in industry standards that could affect Project Medeis. Furthermore, she is supporting the development pipeline of Project Ruzonine and is a key budgetary component under budget code WC-2445-T, with remaining funds allocated for the final stages of testing and integration for the Dronmeman Beacon.

In addition to her project-specific roles, Nosos Nikeis is part of a team focused on refining and optimizing customer onboarding flows to improve user experience and reduce friction during initial engagement, aligning with broader company goals for customer retention and long-term value.&lt;SEP&gt;Nosos Nikeis is a Site Reliability Lead who is being contacted by Zonvor Dirnasor regarding audit findings. They are responsible for reviewing and updating the incident response protocols for the Lozeine Applied Research Lab.&lt;SEP&gt;A person responsible for customer onboarding flows and involved in the meeting. Has a vault key ID: VZ-5413-U.&lt;SEP&gt;Nosos Nikeis is the Site Reliability Lead who joined Zastama Industries in 2024. He has been instrumental in leading the integration of new systems to support increased financial transaction volumes. He ensures the scalability and performance of the infrastructure and provides ongoing technical support.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_b-002-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-014-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-024-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-027-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-030-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-040-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-047-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-052-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-054-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-033-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-007-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-004-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-023-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-team_b-002&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-014&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-024&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-027&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-030&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-040&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-047&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-052&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-054&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-001&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-033&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-007&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-004&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-023</data>
