    <node id="Krosso Velfosan">
      <data key="d0">Krosso Velfosan</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A team member in the procurement and reconciliation team at Zastama Industries, focusing on payments reconciliation and supporting broader finance operations.&lt;SEP&gt;An employee based at the Tupalhasa Field Office who provided an update on its operations and was tasked with submitting an itemized expenditure report.&lt;SEP&gt;Krosso Velfosan is an individual overseeing the reconciliation of payments associated with the escrow reference TH-7214-L. He focuses on payments reconciliation and emphasizes the importance of consistent communication between departments to avoid bottlenecks. He is also responsible for ensuring balance accuracy for the escrow reference before the next fiscal cycle.</data>
