    <node id="Project Dernelnar">
      <data key="d0">Project Dernelnar</data>
      <data key="d1">project</data>
      <data key="d2">Project Dernelnar is a restricted and high-sensitivity initiative focused on internal security infrastructure enhancements. It is currently paused pending a formal review and is led by Pedusel Ruloett, the Head of Security.&lt;SEP&gt;A project progressing under cost center AF-9545-G, with a focus on maintaining alignment with departmental objectives and ensuring cost efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;A high-priority initiative within the Lozeine Applied Research Lab, evolving in parallel with the Zartesis Prism. It is part of the lab's strategic innovation roadmap and involves close collaboration with cross-functional stakeholders.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_b-003-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-024-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-044-chunk-000</data>
