      <data key="d2">Pedusel Ruloett is the Head of Security and the leader of Project Dernelnar. They oversee all aspects of the project, including its strategic direction, implementation, and coordination with stakeholders. They are preparing a comprehensive report for the oversight committee and engaging with advisors to prepare for the review phase.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual who has been granted access to Project Laguran and is associated with an access badge and a contract under review.</data>
