    <node id="Project Kososett">
      <data key="d0">Project Kososett</data>
      <data key="d1">project</data>
      <data key="d2">Project Kososett is a separate initiative at Zastama Industries focused on the enhancement of an external-facing service. It is currently in the planning phase and targets completion in Q3 FY26. No budget code or cost center has been assigned yet, as the project is in the initial setup stages.&lt;SEP&gt;A project currently on track for completion in Q3 FY26, with procurement order PY-3090-J and escrow reference MA-4275-V. It is in the final stages of aligning internal resources and ensuring dependencies are met.&lt;SEP&gt;Project Kososett is an internal initiative aimed at modernizing legacy systems and improving operational efficiency. It is currently in the final stages of implementation and is on track for completion in Q3 FY26.&lt;SEP&gt;A project led by Rerge Tumolan, which was discussed in the meeting for its progress and coordination with other projects.</data>
