    <node id="Project Domesis">
      <data key="d0">Project Domesis</data>
      <data key="d1">project</data>
      <data key="d2">Project Domesis is a collaborative initiative within Zastama Industries involving external support from Gibasan Logistics. It is focused on streamlining supply chain operations and improving logistics workflow efficiency. The project is governed by a services contract and is currently in its initial planning stages, with full implementation expected in the next fiscal quarter.&lt;SEP&gt;A project focused on deploying scalable infrastructure to support long-term field operations, particularly at the Tupalhasa Field Office.&lt;SEP&gt;Project Domesis is a project at Zastama Industries focused on the integration of fleet telemetry systems with user experience design. It has a procurement order NQ-1855-R and a budget code AA-6039-Y, with a completion target of Q1 FY26.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_b-014-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-018-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-046-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-team_b-014&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-018&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-046</data>
      <data key="d5">1793679970</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Gibasan Logistics">
      <data key="d0">Gibasan Logistics</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Gibasan Logistics is a third-party services provider collaborating with Zastama Industries on Project Domesis. It is responsible for logistics support and is governed by a services contract that defines roles, performance metrics, and reporting responsibilities.&lt;SEP&gt;A logistics company contracted by Project Domesis to deliver equipment to the Tupalhasa Field Office under a $3.6M agreement.&lt;SEP&gt;A logistics partner involved in Project Laguran, whose incomplete documentation and unresolved escrow reference are contributing to the project's elevated risk status.&lt;SEP&gt;A vendor contracted by Project Nondaran to support supply chain requirements with a contract valued at $3.6M.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_b-014-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-018-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-022-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-036-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">d-team_b-014&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-018&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-022&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-036</data>
      <data key="d5">1793678222</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
