      <data key="d0">Internal Project Management System</data>
      <data key="d1">system</data>
      <data key="d2">The Internal Project Management System is a secure, restricted-access environment where staffing and role assignments for Project Drutoett and Project Domesis are maintained. Access is granted only to authorized personnel.</data>
