    <node id="Ragos Drosporel">
      <data key="d0">Ragos Drosporel</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Ragos Drosporel is the Operations Manager at the Tupalhasa Field Office and is overseeing the coordination between forecasting models and operational implementation.&lt;SEP&gt;Ragos Drosporel is an Operations Manager who is currently employed under contract reference CW-4581-M. She is directly responsible for the operational oversight of Project Golgoett, a project staffed by 10 people. An audit finding (ID: HK-2924-K) has been identified concerning discrepancies in the reporting and allocation of resources under her supervision.&lt;SEP&gt;Operations Manager who raised concerns about potential bottlenecks during the transition phase and will be part of the working group.&lt;SEP&gt;A personnel member at the Tupalhasa Field Office who is coordinating with the internal compliance team.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_b-017-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-050-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-052-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-058-chunk-000</data>
