    </node>
    <node id="Tupalhasa Field Office">
      <data key="d0">Tupalhasa Field Office</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Tupalhasa Field Office is the location where both Buthia Norven and the Lozeine Applied Research Lab are based, and it is the central hub for the coordination of forecasting and operational planning efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;A remote field office where equipment is being delivered as part of Project Domesis.&lt;SEP&gt;A field office of Zastama Industries where operations and compliance reviews are being conducted.&lt;SEP&gt;A field office opened in 2024, functioning as a regional hub for logistics and field operations, with a focus on streamlining processes in the region.&lt;SEP&gt;A field office of Zastama Industries where the Donnoett Loom is hosted and where operations are conducted.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_b-017-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-018-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-058-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-057-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-035-chunk-000</data>
