      <data key="d0">Feedback Loop</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A feedback loop is being developed to allow operational teams to provide real-world data back to the modeling team, supporting model refinement and ensuring alignment with operational realities.&lt;SEP&gt;Feedback Loop is a planned initiative at the Zasdaett Harbor to gather input from select users. It aims to better align the platform’s evolution with user expectations.</data>
