    <node id="Project Krabinel">
      <data key="d0">Project Krabinel</data>
      <data key="d1">project</data>
      <data key="d2">Project Krabinel is a project currently under audit with reference code ER-9752-Y. It is being monitored closely due to audit findings and requires a corrective action plan.&lt;SEP&gt;A project with a Q2 FY28 completion target. It involves a services contract with Brepemrir Logistics and is being coordinated by Zunhu Kusasteis.&lt;SEP&gt;A project whose lead attended the meeting and discussed access control systems and coordination with Project Kososett.</data>
