    <node id="Project Laguran">
      <data key="d0">Project Laguran</data>
      <data key="d1">project</data>
      <data key="d2">Project Laguran is a high-risk initiative flagged due to delays in vendor coordination and budgetary constraints. It requires a reassessment of timelines and budget commitments.&lt;SEP&gt;A project currently at risk due to delays in vendor coordination and incomplete documentation, which has prompted an urgent review of its status and access permissions.&lt;SEP&gt;Project Laguran is a project currently in phase three of deployment, with the escrow process under review. It is progressing toward the next phase of funding and requires approval of the escrow documentation under reference VB-3081-T.&lt;SEP&gt;An ongoing project at Zastama Industries, currently at risk due to vendor delivery delays and internal resource allocation issues. The procurement order ZS-5188-S is a key component of the project.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_b-020-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-022-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-030-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-055-chunk-000</data>
