    <node id="Zizadal Infrastructure Team">
      <data key="d0">Zizadal Infrastructure Team</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Zizadal Infrastructure Team is responsible for the development and maintenance of the Brapoett Vault, ensuring its robustness and compliance with standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The Zizadal Infrastructure Team is a group within the organization responsible for maintaining and supporting core infrastructure needs across internal systems and project platforms. The team has a stable headcount of 32 people and operates under budget code XG-2588-P. It is currently involved in a long-term scalability review for the Lorhia Loom platform and supports key system integrations for Project Nondaran.&lt;SEP&gt;The team responsible for managing and executing Project Medeis. They are ensuring that all infrastructure components are on schedule and within budget.&lt;SEP&gt;The Zizadal Infrastructure Team is responsible for managing and maintaining core infrastructure initiatives, including Project Medeis and the Zasdaett Harbor. The team focuses on system stability, growth, and operational efficiency.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-team_b-041-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-042-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-052-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-team_b-056-chunk-000</data>
