      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The IT Security Lead is a role responsible for overseeing information security within the organization. In this context, the IT Security Lead confirmed the secure management of the Zizadal Infrastructure Team’s vault key ID and will ensure quarterly access reviews.&lt;SEP&gt;A person who confirmed that the proposed tools align with the organization’s compliance and data protection standards and requested vendor security certifications.&lt;SEP&gt;A person in the role of IT security lead who participated in the meeting and was involved in reviewing system access protocols.</data>
