    <node id="Dronmeman Beacon">
      <data key="d0">Dronmeman Beacon</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The Dronmeman Beacon is a high-priority initiative currently in development, with major phases progressing as planned. It is scheduled for a Q3 FY28 launch and requires strict adherence to budget and timeline constraints.&lt;SEP&gt;A key component of Project Thedraman, scheduled for launch in Q3 FY28, and currently under coordination for deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;A project or system under development, with a scheduled Q3 FY28 launch, currently in the engineering phase and undergoing audit and compliance reviews.&lt;SEP&gt;The Dronmeman Beacon is a new initiative being developed by Zastama Industries, with a scheduled launch in Q3 FY28. It aims to enhance internal communication and data integration capabilities and is in the final stages of preparation.</data>
      <data key="d3">d-exec-001-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-025-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-041-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-exec-059-chunk-000</data>
