      <data key="d2">Sesoa Bokrelis is a key team member who joined the company in 2014 and has played a significant role in the development of the Dronmeman Beacon. She is leading the final testing phase and working closely with external vendors.&lt;SEP&gt;Sesoa Bokrelis is an employee who joined the company in 2014. They are involved in reviewing the budget for Project Hinzosine and communicating with stakeholders to ensure alignment in financial reporting.&lt;SEP&gt;An employee of Zastama Industries since 2014, responsible for procurement activities and secure access to restricted company facilities.&lt;SEP&gt;A person who has been with the company since 2014 and participated in the meeting. Provided feedback on onboarding efficiency and access rule inconsistencies.</data>
