      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A department within the company consisting of 32 people. It operates under a phased access control model and is involved in data-driven decision-making within a secure and auditable framework.&lt;SEP&gt;The Zetrais Analytics Unit is a department within Zastama Industries composed of 32 personnel and led by Gunpa Kemtois. It has been identified in an internal audit for issues related to access control and data handling procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;The Zetrais Analytics Unit is a department responsible for providing data-driven insights across multiple business functions. It has 32 members and is currently operating at full capacity with all team members engaged in active projects. The unit supports the Gahikron Campus and other internal departments by analyzing data to inform decision-making.</data>
