    <edge source="Zastama Industries" target="Bekuine Consulting">
      <data key="d7">9.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Zastama Industries and Bekuine Consulting share a professional relationship characterized by a structured and ongoing collaboration. The two entities are bound by a 24-month master services agreement, under which Bekuine Consulting provides Zastama Industries with expertise in process optimization, risk assessment, and strategic planning. This partnership is also focused on the delivery of new equipment to the Lardoel Campus, indicating a practical application of Bekuine Consulting’s advisory services.

Zastama Industries has contracted Bekuine Consulting for equipment delivery and is currently preparing for contract renewal, suggesting a positive evaluation of the ongoing collaboration. The relationship is also being managed with strict financial controls, particularly as part of the Petoine Console project, which highlights the importance of fiscal oversight in their partnership. Multiple descriptions confirm the existence of a contract between the two entities, with the master services agreement being consistently referenced across several accounts.</data>
      <data key="d9">collaborates with,collaboration,consulting,contract,contracts,engages,financial controls,has contract with,partners with,partnership,support,vendor relationship</data>
