    <edge source="Zastama Industries" target="Innovation">
      <data key="d7">14.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Zastama Industries places a strong emphasis on innovation as a core value, strategic objective, and guiding principle across its operations. The company fosters innovation as a central goal, encouraging it among employees and integrating it into its tools, projects, and overall mission. Innovation is not only a value but also a strategic focus, reflected in the company’s initiatives and long-term planning. 

Notably, Zastama Industries supports innovation through specific teams and platforms, such as the Drurlomis Integration Team and the Drugoan Platform Group, which contribute to the development and implementation of innovative solutions. One example of this focus is seen in initiatives like Project Sankonen, where innovation plays a particularly prominent role. 

Across all levels of the organization, from strategic planning to day-to-day operations, innovation is consistently highlighted as a driving force behind Zastama Industries’ growth and success.&lt;SEP&gt;Innovation is a core value at Zastama Industries.&lt;SEP&gt;Zastama Industries values innovation as a key driver of success.&lt;SEP&gt;Zastama Industries emphasizes innovation in its operations and development initiatives.&lt;SEP&gt;Zastama Industries focuses on innovation through its strategic projects and research initiatives.</data>
