      <data key="d8">The Pozoine Campus is a facility operated and owned by Zastama Industries, serving as a central hub for a wide range of organizational functions. It is a key location for several departments and teams within the company, supporting various operational and infrastructure activities. The campus is also home to the Vesterge Ledger and is the base of operations for Bedras Sarkua, indicating its strategic importance within Zastama Industries' structure. As part of the company's broader organizational framework, the Pozoine Campus plays a central role in housing key personnel and facilitating important business operations.</data>
