    <edge source="Zastama Industries" target="Drurlomis Integration Team">
      <data key="d7">10.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Drurlomis Integration Team is an internal team within Zastama Industries, responsible for integration-focused activities and managing key projects. As part of Zastama Industries, the team operates under the company's oversight and is employed to support its operational goals. The primary function of the Drurlomis Integration Team is to integrate new systems and protocols, align and synchronize data and access systems across departments, and enhance overall operational efficiency. 

Zastama Industries provides support to the Drurlomis Integration Team in its integration efforts, which include working on specific projects such as the Tanumett Relay. The team plays a critical role in ensuring that systems and processes across the organization are cohesive and function effectively. Through its work, the Drurlomis Integration Team contributes to the broader strategic objectives of Zastama Industries by facilitating seamless data flow and system interoperability.&lt;SEP&gt;The Drurlomis Integration Team is a subunit of Zastama Industries working on integration efforts.</data>
      <data key="d9">affiliation,aligns,collaborates with,employs,initiative,operates within,oversees,parent,part of,subunit,supports,team</data>
      <data key="d10">d-public-009-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-044-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-074-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-077-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-080-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-086-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-114-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;d-public-098-chunk-000</data>
