      <data key="d8">Hurpuman Partners is a trusted vendor collaborating with Zastama Industries to supply components for the Broltala Loom.&lt;SEP&gt;Zastama Industries collaborates with Hurpuman Partners to maintain product quality and reliability.&lt;SEP&gt;Zastama Industries collaborates with Hurpuman Partners on the delivery of components for the Broltala Loom and has a services contract for Project Porkuine.&lt;SEP&gt;Zastama Industries contracts with Hurpuman Partners to support Project Daslalett.&lt;SEP&gt;Zastama Industries has a vendor relationship with Hurpuman Partners, operating under a 18-month master services agreement. Hurpuman Partners delivers equipment to the Thamhuor Campus and is a key vendor for Zastama.</data>
