    <edge source="Zastama Industries" target="Collaboration">
      <data key="d7">12.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Collaboration is a core value and fundamental principle at Zastama Industries, deeply embedded in its organizational culture and operational approach. The company emphasizes collaboration across all departments, teams, and locations, fostering a unified and integrated working environment. This collaborative ethos is particularly evident in the company’s approach to project implementation and system enhancement, where teamwork is seen as essential for achieving efficiency and innovation. Zastama Industries encourages open communication and joint efforts to ensure effective resource allocation and successful project execution. Additionally, the company places special emphasis on collaboration with external partners, notably Brimumor Labs, highlighting the importance of strategic alliances in driving growth and development.&lt;SEP&gt;Zastama Industries values collaboration in all operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Collaboration is a core value at Zastama Industries.&lt;SEP&gt;Zastama Industries encourages collaboration among employees to achieve success through teamwork.&lt;SEP&gt;Zastama Industries promotes collaboration among cross-functional teams.</data>
