    <edge source="Zastama Industries" target="Resource Allocation">
      <data key="d7">9.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Resource allocation is a critical strategic concern for Zastama Industries, reflecting its importance in managing operations and achieving organizational goals. The company actively manages resource allocation across departments and projects, with a particular focus on initiatives such as Project Dramen and the next phase of Project Lovulett. These efforts are aimed at ensuring efficient use of resources and maximizing capacity to deliver on strategic priorities.

Zastama Industries aligns its resource allocation strategies to support continuity in key initiatives, including those that rely on key personnel such as Tevuel Rinael. The company is also planning for future resource allocation to support upcoming initiatives, demonstrating a forward-looking approach to its operational needs. However, Zastama Industries faces risks stemming from resource allocation challenges, underscoring the complexity and importance of this function within the organization.&lt;SEP&gt;Zastama Industries manages resource allocation to support various initiatives.</data>
