    <edge source="Zastama Industries" target="Strategic Goals">
      <data key="d7">9.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Zastama Industries' strategic goals represent the overarching objectives that guide the company's long-term success and operational direction. These goals are integrated across various aspects of the business, including infrastructure, operations, supply chain, and financial decision-making, ensuring alignment at all levels of the organization. Through focused initiatives and key partnerships, Zastama Industries actively pursues these strategic goals, which are designed to drive innovation and competitive advantage.

One of the key areas of focus within these strategic goals is innovation in autonomous systems, reflecting the company's commitment to technological advancement. Projects such as the Tanumett Relay are explicitly aligned with these goals, particularly for the fiscal year 2027, demonstrating how specific initiatives are structured to support broader strategic ambitions. By consistently aligning its initiatives with these strategic objectives, Zastama Industries aims to maintain coherence and effectiveness in its pursuit of sustained growth and industry leadership.&lt;SEP&gt;Zastama Industries supports its strategic goals through the progress of various projects and initiatives.</data>
