    <edge source="Zastama Industries" target="Operational Efficiency">
      <data key="d7">8.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Operational efficiency is a strategic goal of Zastama Industries, reflecting the company's commitment to enhancing its internal operations. As part of its broader internal improvements, Zastama Industries focuses on operational efficiency as a company-wide objective for the next quarter. This focus extends to specific areas such as space usage and team workflows, where the company aims to implement meaningful improvements. 

Zastama Industries has already achieved notable gains in operational efficiency through process improvements, demonstrating its ability to enact successful change. To sustain this efficiency, the company emphasizes the proper alignment of service expectations with contractual obligations, ensuring that all operational activities remain consistent with agreed-upon standards. Additionally, Zastama Industries maintains operational efficiency through the oversight of vendor access and renewal, reinforcing its structured approach to managing external relationships. Overall, operational efficiency remains a central pillar of Zastama Industries' operational and strategic priorities.</data>
